<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Arum Bibleh translation</book>
  <para style="h">Vuru Tsifa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Vuru Tsifa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vuru Tsifa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vur</para>
  <para style="mt1">VURU TSIFA</para>
  <para style="mt2">MA AYOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Vuru tsifa ma Ayohana reh, tama a ŋa na ameh ata tama ka a leh a nga iya ma amboh tufa Kristi mboh tsifa ata nza ma a nga agohsoh amoh ma Kristi tswanza Ada reh. Kyangwri ŋa amgbasho ata areh reh, a ŋa tsifa la ŋoh ta a nga wuwa agohsoh tasa gya agohsoh ma amboh ata nza ma a bleh amgbasho reh, tasa za la mata a leh a lisa alindeh na ameh iya tasa ameh ata nza ma a leh a nga mboh iya reh. Kyangwri ata nza a ŋa amgbasho ata reh za tana a wa iya veve kpeh, maka a gu ŋoh na wuwana a na imbla anyi nza maka a fi la Batmos. A bu ma mareh ŋa nza maka a tsana ŋoh awumu mboh reh ma wono. Amgbasho reh a tsana wono mboh reh ma a sa, a bu amboh tufa mboh nza ma a nati a nza wono mboh reh a wina, amboh ata neh nza ma a bu amboh tufa mboh kpeh reh a nati a bu na iya mata a nza a wina. Amgbasho reh a tsana za la Nnoh a nati a nga iya ma amboh ata nza ma a fi ŋoh ma tohmoh reh tasa Agugu za. amboh ata nza ma a lisa alindeh reh ma a nati a hunji firoh alindeh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh a bleh Tsifa mboh ata Yeso Kristi nza a vuru a tsana reh. Nnoh a nga ŋoh dehreh la ta a tsana ma ahwra a ŋoh mboh andromboh ata nza a nati a ba kanga ahwri kpeh reh. Kristi reh a tohmoh Amehreh tohmoh a ŋoh la ta a na na a bleh tsifa reh ma Ayohana ahwra ŋoh, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />ŋoh Ayohana tana bleh tsifa ma ikpi awumu amboh reh nambri ata Nnoh nza a tsana ŋoh reh. Amboh areh ma bu tsifa ata a zizi anyi na Nnoh. Ma bu bleh tsifa amboh ata Yeso Kristi nza a bleh la ma bu zizi reh. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Te atoh a bu na akyo ata nza a bleh tsifa mboh nimeh amgbasho amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh reh, tasa za te atoh a bu na amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa reh, mboh reh maka a tufa andromboh ata nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh. Ameh ata awumu mboh a nati a bu dehreh reh kǝ ba inda.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayohana A ŋa A na Ma amboh Tufa Mboh Nza ma A bu Ma Akpokpo Afiyafiya mboh Atehrehkifi Na Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya Ayohana a na na amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh atehrehkifi na anyi ma akpo inzi Asiya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Lisa alindeh tasa tuma alindeh ata nza anyi na Nnoh ta a bu na amohnoh, ŋoh ata nza a yama nehnehreh, tasa ŋoh ata ta ka a yama na kpikpi reh tasa ŋoh ata nza a nati a ba reh, tasa za anyi na huru mboh atehrehkifi na anyi nza ma a bu ma tohmoh kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh reh, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />tasa za anyi na Yeso Kristi, ŋoh ata ka a lisa yehlehleh ta a bleh ma ikpi Nnoh reh. A bu ŋoh ata tama ka a jiji a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo reh, tasa za ŋoh tana a bu Agohmoh agohgohmoh mboh ma inziyo areh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">A kira na ambohroh, tasa za a sa reh a hwana anyi ma kpakpana ambohroh mboh ma aki sangra imya a ŋoh <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />tasa za a lisa reh a ba nimeh kpra Agohmoh meh bu tswanza Firist mboh meh ti te ndohmoh ma Nnoh a ŋoh tasa Ada. Agba a bu na Yeso Kristi zizi tasa wuwana ata tuma atono! Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Nza, a nati a ba nimeh avereh, kyangwri mboh nambri ma a nati a nza ŋoh, a nati a mishi amboh ata tama ka a hahamba ŋoh reh za. Kyangwri mboh ma inziyo areh nambri ma a nati a kpanga ŋoh. A nati ka bu dehreh!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Ada Nnoh ata nza a bu na wuwana reh a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Mya meh bu jiji tasa ata trinaa,&gt;&gt; ŋoh ata nza a yama nehnehreh, tasa ŋoh ata nza a yama na kiri reh, tasa ŋoh ata nza a nati a ba za reh.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayohana A nza Kristi Ma Huru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Mya meh bu Ayohana, atsi amohnoh, tswanza mya nza ni bu kyangwri tufa Yeso, meh bu atohngoh amohnoh nimeh wa iya tasa kpra Agohmoh tasa soh ivoh yira de ikpi ahroh ata ma bu ambohroh nimeh Yeso. Tama a gu meh na wuwana a na ma akpo inzi anyi kakere ma atsitsifi amwo ata maka a fi la Batmos tsifa la meh leh bleh tsifa Nnoh tasa za la meh leh tsifa ma ikpi Yeso. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Nimeh ibi ata nza a bu Ada ŋoh reh, Huru Nnoh ka tamba ma ikpi amya, meh kǝ sere agba anyi atsi gohroh ma nyina amya tswanza gohroh drumu reh <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />A bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ŋa awumu amboh ata nza ni nza reh, ti tohmoh amgbasho reh na na amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma akpokpo afiyafiya agbugba mboh atehrehkifi na anyi reh, ma bu, Afisa, tasa Simirna, tasa Birgamum, tasa Tiyatira, tasa Sardis, tasa Filadelfiya, tasa za Lawudikiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Meh gyuruna meh ti nza la ha a ka bu anyi a leh atsifa na amya, meh kǝ nza ikpoh kohhroh shira atehrehkifi na anyi reh ata ma a lisa na kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwri reh, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />tasa za ma atsitsifi ikpoh koro shira mboh reh, meh nza andromboh anyi a tswanza amehreh kyangwri a were izeh kuri, tasa za ma a lafa a gbo agohsoh a ŋoh na rishi kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwri ŋoh. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Shina ikpi a ŋoh a kasa a tswanza alulu reh tasa za a tswanza talala reh, iyo a ŋoh mboh a tswanza arimi shira reh; <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />hwana a ŋoh mboh reh ma a zana tswanza karafi ata nza ma a hwa tasa ata ma a yaha nimeh shira agǝgǝgri, agba a ŋoh reh a gohroh tswanza amwo ata nza a gbo reh. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />A de akpukpa atehrehkifi na anyi reh ma ivoh rya a kpa a ŋoh, tasa za ambya gara ata nza a bu na aniye afri ata ka a rya vehveh kpeh a kate anyi ma aniye a ŋoh. Tomwo a ŋoh a zana tswanza a nza noh.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Mya nza kǝ nza ŋoh reh, Meh kǝ hwa ma ambasa hwana a ŋoh tswanza kohmoh kyangwri reh. A ka a gu ivoh rya a kpa a ŋoh a gya meh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kama nyiri kpeh! Mya meh bu jiji ŋoh tasa trina ŋoh. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Mya meh bu na fene! Meh tini kwo, nehnehreh neh meh gyuru bu na fene ata tuma atono. Meh bu na wuwana ma ikpi kwo tasa ata atsi tuma kunu mboh. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Ŋa awumu amboh ata ni buti nza nehnehreh, tasa awumu amboh ata ma a buti ba ma aki ma nyina amboh ata areh reh. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Ata areh a bu lomo ata huho ata akpukpa atehrehkifi na anyi ata ni nza na mgba ivoh rya a kpa amya reh, tasa ikpoh koro shira atehrehkifi na anyi ata ma a lisa na kpakpa hungroh ahungwri: Akpukpa mboh atehrehkifi na anyi reh ma bu mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh nza ma a bu ma dida Nnoh atehrehkifi na anyi reh, tasa ikpoh shira atehrehkifi na anyi reh ma bu dida Nnoh atehrehkifi na anyi reh.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Sa Tohmoh Na Amboh Tufa Mboh Ma Afisa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />&lt;&lt;Ŋa amgbasho reh na na Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata amboh tufa mboh nza ma a bu ma Afisa reh la,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">&lt;&lt;Tohmoh ata areh anyi na ŋoh ata nza a de akpukpa mboh atehrehkifi na anyi na mgba ivoh rya a kpa a ŋoh reh, tasa za a bu ŋoh ata nza a hehndeh ma hohroh ikpoh kohhroh shira ata kpakpa hungroh ahungwri atehrehkifi na anyi reh.<verse eid="REV 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Meh wina ndohmoh ata nza ni te wuwa reh, tasa za meh wina ndohmoh ata nnoh nza ni te nimeh de ikpi ahroh tasa nimeh soh ivoh ma yira reh. Meh wina la ni nati wina soh ivoh ma yira na kyangwri amboh agugu kpeh, tasa za ni tsara amboh ata nza ma a fi ikpi amoh la ma bu amboh ble tsifa nana, neh ma bu mboh reh kpeh, mboh reh ma bu amboh bleh tsifa huru tsifa. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Ni bu na soh ivoh yira, tasa za ni kǝ de ikpi ahroh nimeh iya tsifa isa amya, tasa ni kǝ kohhoh kpeh. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Mya neh meh bu na andromboh ata meh nati bleh ma ikpi anzoh, ni za kira na amya tswanza ata jiji reh za kpeh. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Kohnoh na biroh hwa anzoh ata kpikpi reh! Ta kpakpana anzoh mboh reh tasa za ni gyuru na anzoh na ndohmoh anzoh amboh jiji reh. Nza ni ta kpakpana anzoh mboh reh kpeh, meh nati ba na anzoh meh ti gu ikpoh kohhroh shira anzoh reh nyi ma atsi tuma a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Ata areh neh a bu andromboh ata ni lisa yehlehleh, ni leke andromboh ata Nikolatawa nza a lisa reh tswanza mya za nza ni leke mboh reh. <verse eid="REV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sehreh reh, ta sehreh andromboh ata huru nza a bleh ma amboh tufa mboh reh!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">Amboh ata nza ma a shi a keh wuwana reh, meh nati nga mboh kira tama a rya mara agbeh ata ka a de fene a ba ata nza a bu nimeh Aye Nnoh reh.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tohmoh na Amboh tufa mboh ma Simirna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />&lt;&lt;Ŋa tohmoh ata areh na na Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma Simirna reh la,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">Tohmoh ata areh anyi na akyo ata ŋoh nza a bu ata jiji tasa ata trinaa reh, tana a kwo a ka a gyuru a bu na fene yama. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Meh wina iya ata nnoh nza ni bu nimeh reh; meh wina za la ni bu iya anzoh ma, nnoh neh ni bu na asabara ata a zizi, meh wina tsifa abibi ata amboh ata nza ma a leh a fi ikpi amoh la Yahudawa mboh nza ma a leh a bleh ma ikpi anzoh reh, neh a bu dehreh kpeh; mboh reh ma bu ida dohsohna agugu mboh! <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Kama nyiri na iya ata nnoh nza ni nati wa reh kpeh. Sehreh! Agugu reh a nati a tsara nnoh a nza ma aki ata nza ma a nati a fira mgbiri amohnoh mboh a were a na ma ida ka, iya anzoh reh a nati a bu ibi agrumavoh. Lisa meh yehlehleh, ha a bu kwo a nati a gu nnoh, mya meh nati nga nnoh fene ata nza a nati a bu gbama firoh rya tohmoh anzoh.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh reh, ta a sehreh andromboh ata huru nza a leh a bleh ma amboh tufa mboh reh!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">Amboh ata nza a nati a shi mata a keh agugu reh, kwo ata afri reh a nati a bara mboh kpeh mbimbi.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tohmoh Na na amboh Tufa Mboh Nza ma A bu ma Birgamum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />Ŋa amgbasho ata areh na na Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh amboh tufa mboh nza ma a bu ma Birgamum reh la:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">Tohmoh ata areh anyi na ŋoh ata nza a de ambya gara ata nza a bu rya ŋoh na mgba afri ma veve kpeh. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Meh wina atsi tuma anzoh, a bu atsi ata agugu nza a tuma ma kpra Agohmoh reh. Neh ni de isa amya wuwa, tasa za ni sohroh ta nga agohsoh anzoh na amya kpeh, tasa na ameh ata Antifas ahwra amya ata nza ka a bleh tsifa yehlehleh ma ikpi amya reh, tama a mla ŋoh a kwo ma atsi ata agugu nza a bu reh. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Mya neh meh hunji noh na kpakpana amboh anyi, kyangwri amboh anyi ma a yama nimeh amohnoh nza ma a leh a tufa tsana Balaam, ata ŋoh nza a tsana Balak la ta a yiyi Israila mboh mata a kpakpana, ma a rya irya ata nza ma a lisa a gya ma nnoh akǝkehreh mboh reh tasa za ma a leh a te inyo atsi hende leh ahohndoh. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Ma aki wohroh za, kyangwri amboh anyi ma a yama nimeh amohnoh amboh ata nza ma a leh a tufa tsana Nikolatawa reh. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Gyuruna ta aki agugu anzoh mboh reh nehnehreh! Nza ni leke reh, meh nati ba na anzoh meh ti mla na na kyangwri amboh wohroh na ambya gara ata nza a nati a kate anyi ma aniye amya reh. <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh reh, ta a sehreh andromboh ata huru nza a leh a bleh ma amboh tufa Nnoh mboh reh! &lt;&lt;Amboh ata nza ma a nati a shi mata a rya a keh reh, meh nati nga ŋoh nyi nimeh mgbiri manna ata nza ma a gya a huho reh. Tasa za meh nati nga mboh kpakpa atasaa reh ma asaa, ata nza ma a ŋa isa afeh ŋoh ma ikpi reh, ata akyo a sohroh a wina isa reh kpeh, nza a bu akyo ata nza a sa kpakpa reh feh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tohmoh na Tiyatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />&lt;&lt;Ŋa na Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata amboh tufa mboh nza ma a bu ma Tiyatira reh la:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">&lt;&lt;Tohmoh ata areh anyi na amehreh Nnoh, ata iyo a ŋoh mboh nza afya a tswanza shira, ambasa hwana a ŋoh mboh za ma a srehmehna a tswanza dalma.<verse eid="REV 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Meh wina andromboh ata nnoh nza ni lisa reh. Tasa za meh wina kira tasa meh wina lisa alindeh anzoh, ndohmoh anzoh tasa soh ivoh yira anzoh. Meh wina la ni leh lisa awumu mboh nehnehreh keh amboh jiji mboh reh. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Mya neh meh bu na andromboh ata meh nati bleh ma ikpi anzoh: Ni tuma nza afiya ata nza ma a fi isa a ŋoh la Yezebel reh ta, ŋoh ata nza a leh a fi ikpi a ŋoh la kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh reh. Ma aki tsana a ŋoh reh, a leh a landa ahwra amya mboh reh mata a leh a te ndohmoh inyo atsi leh ahohndoh, tasa za ma a leh a rya irya ata nza ma a de a ba ngǝnga ma nnoh akǝkehreh mboh reh. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Mya meh nga ŋoh aki la ta ata kpakpana a ŋoh reh, ŋoh neh a leke ta a gyuruna ata ndohmoh leh ahohndoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Ma ikpi wohroh reh, meh nati gu ŋoh shebiri na ma ikpi tundu mata a leh mboh ma amboh ata nza ma a leh ahohndoh ma amoh reh a wa iya. Meh nati lisa dehreh nehnehreh, nza tama ata ndohmoh agugu amoh ata nza ma a lisa na a ŋoh reh feh. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Meh nati mla amboh ata nza ma a tufa a ŋoh mboh reh kwo, tasa amboh tufa mboh reh nambri ma a nati a wina la, a bu mya ata mya nza ni wina kohnoh amoh mboh reh nambri tasa andromboh ata mboh nza ma a kira reh. Meh nati fanga nnoh yehlehleh na ndohmoh ata mohnoh nza ni te nnoh reh.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Mgbiri amohnoh neh amboh ata nza ni yama nnoh ma Tiyatira reh, ni sohroh tufa nnoh tsana ata agugu reh kpeh. Ni sohroh kpehkpehteh nnoh andromboh ata amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh nza ma a fi la, &lt;Tsifa ayuhu ata agugu nza a bu na niye reh kpeh.&gt; Meh bleh noh la meh nati za lafa nnoh awumu rishi anyi za kpeh. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Mohnoh neh de noh andromboh ata nza ni bu noh na wohroh reh wuwa nnoh kanga, mya tini gyuru ba feh. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Amboh ata nza ma a nati a shi mata a rya mlana reh a keh, tasa za amboh ata ma a nati a shi a na ma trinaa, mata a lisa andromboh ata mya nza ni kira reh, meh nati nga ŋoh wuwana ta a de Agohmoh akpokpo inzizi mboh. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Meh nati de mboh na ikpoh karafi, tasa za meh nati vavasa mboh te alulu tswanza azo lo reh. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Ma a nati a bu na wuwana ika ata mya nza ni sa nyi na Ada amya reh, tasa za meh nati bu akweh nerebi za.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Nza ni bu na ashotoh reh, sehreh andromboh ata huru nza a leh a bleh ma amboh tufa mboh reh.<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Sa Tohmoh Na Amboh Tufa mboh Ma Sardis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />&lt;&lt;Ŋa amgbasho reh na na Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh amboh tufa mboh ata nza a bu ma Sardis reh la,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">&lt;&lt;Tohmoh ata areh anyi na ŋoh ata nza a bu na huru Nnoh atehrehkifi na anyi tasa akpukpa mboh atehrehkifi na anyi reh. Mya meh wina andromboh ata nnoh nza ni leh lisa reh, meh wina la kyangwri mboh ma a leh a gu ma agohsoh amoh la ni bu na fene ma agohsoh anzoh, ata areh neh a bu zizi kpeh tsifa la ni bu kohmoh nimeh huru anzoh. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Nza a bu dehreh reh, hinga nyi ma mla, ti lisa de andromboh ata nza a hwa reh wuwa feh sa a kwo a trina. Mya meh nza la andromboh ata nnoh nza ni lisa reh a sohroh a bu yehlehleh ma tomo Ada amya kpeh. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Nza bu dehreh reh, kohnoh na andromboh ata nza ma a tsana noh tasa na andromboh ata nza ni sehreh za reh, lisa tufa mboh yehlehleh tasa za ti ta kpakpana anzoh mboh reh, nza ni nati hinga kpeh, meh nati ba tswanza ayuhu reh, ni nati sohroh wina ameh ata meh nati ba reh kpeh. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Mgbiri amohnoh neh amboh ata nza ni bu noh ma Sardis reh, ni sohroh ta nnoh akuri amohnoh mboh na arishi kpeh. Ni nati hende noh na amya, ti were nnoh akuri atatasaa, tsifa la ni tswa ti lisa nnoh dehreh. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Amboh ata nza ma a shi a wuwana a keh reh, ma a nati a were mboh akuri atatasaa ika ata amoh reh, tasa za meh nati sohroh fufa isa amoh nyi nimeh amgbasho ata fene reh kpeh. Meh nati bleh ma tomo Ada amya tasa mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh meh nati bleh kate la amboh areh ma bu kyangwri amya mboh. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sehreh reh, ta a sehreh andromboh ata huru nza a bleh ma amboh tufa mboh reh!<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">De Tohmoh na Amboh Tufa mboh ma Filadelfiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />&lt;&lt;Ŋa amgbasho reh na na Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh amboh tufa amboh ata nza a bu ma akpo afiya agba ma Filadelfiya la, &lt;&lt;Tohmoh ata areh anyi na ŋoh ata nza a bu na huru tasa za ka a bleh zizi. A bu na akroh ka anida Agohmoh Dawuda reh, nza ŋoh kǝ vuru anida reh, akyo anyi a za a nati a wina hama anida za kpeh, tasa nza ŋoh kǝ hama reh, akyo anyi a za a nati a wina vuru anida reh za kpeh. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Meh wina ndohmoh anzoh; meh wina za la ni bu na wuwana shidi ma; Nnoh ni tufa tsana amya mboh reh tasa za ni bu yehlehleh na amya. Meh vuru anida ma tomo anzoh, ata akyo anyi a nati a wina hama anida reh kpeh. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Sehreh! Tswanza kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu ata agugu reh, mboh amboh huru tsifa amboh ata nza ma a gu ikpi amoh la mboh ma bu Yahudawa mboh reh, neh a bu dehreh kpeh. Meh nati lisa kyangwri amboh wohroh mata a ba ba a susuna ma tomo anzoh. Ma a nati a wina nambri ma amoh la meh kira na anzoh. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Tsifa la ni de ikpi ahroh ma atsi tufa tsifa amya mboh reh, meh nati de noh alindeh za a gu nyi ameh ata iya agba a nati a ba ma inziyo ta a ba ba a tsara kyangwri mboh nambri ma inziyo reh. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />A nati a yanda kpeh meh nati ba. De andromboh ata nza ni bu na wohroh reh wuwa, la akyo anyi ta sohroh a sa firoh anzoh ata rya keh reh a hwana kpeh. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Meh nati lisa amboh ata nza ma a shi a mlana a keh reh mata bu ingri nimeh ida Nnoh amya, ma a nati a sohroh ata afiya Nnoh reh za kpeh. Meh nati ŋa isa Nnoh amya tasa isa akpo afiya Nnoh amya ma ikpi a ŋoh, wohroh reh a bu Wurushalima afeh reh, ata nza a nati anyi inza na Nnoh amya a ba. Meh nati ŋa mboh isa amya afeh reh za ma ikpi amoh. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sehreh reh, ta a sehreh andromboh ata huru nza a bleh ma amboh tufa mboh reh!<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tohmoh na Amboh Tufa mboh ma Lawudikiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />&lt;&lt;Ŋa amgbasho reh na na Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma Lawudikiya reh la,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">&lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu tohmoh ata nza anyi na akyo ata nza ma a fi sa a ŋoh la Avoh dehreh, ŋoh ka a lisa yehlehleh tasa za ka a bleh kyangwri mboh tsifa Nnoh ata a zizi reh. Nza anyi na a ŋoh Nnoh a lisa awumu mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Meh wina ndohmoh anzoh, ni sohroh bu gbalala ha neh ti yaha kpeh. Ma a keh zohhoh la ti bu gbalala ha ti yaha. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Nnoh neh ni hwene ma, ni sohroh yaha ha ti bu gbalala kpeh, meh nati tohfoh nnoh kate nyi ma aniye amya! <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Ni bleh la, &lt;Meh bu na asabara; meh za sohroh chi andromboh anyi za kpeh,&gt; Meh bu na awumu mboh reh nambri, nnoh neh ni sohroh wina la ni bu iya ma kpeh, tasa za ni nga kwini ma kyangwri mboh, ni bu iya anzoh ma, tasa za ni bu na mgbimgbi tasa za ni sohroh nza atsifi kpeh. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Nza a bu dehreh, meh bleh noh la ti sa kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwri reh nyi na amya, kpakpa hungroh ata a zizi reh la ti te asabara. Sa akuri atatasaa za la ti jimi itoh anzoh tasa za ti hama isa ata nza ni nati a de mgbimgbi a ba reh. Tasa za ti sa amehneh iyo nyi na amya were ma iyo anzoh mboh, la ti nza atsifi alindeh. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Meh nati kpi ashotoh tasa za meh ti nga iya ma amboh ata mya nza ni kira na amoh reh. Nza a bu dehreh, shi wuwana ti ta kpakpana anzoh mboh reh. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Sehreh! Mya meh shi ma anida afiya anzoh, meh leh kpa anida; nza akyo ata nza a sehreh agba amya ta a vuru anida reh, meh nati niye ba nimeh meh ti rya na a ŋoh, tasa ŋoh za a nati a rya na amya. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Amboh ata nza ma a shi a mlana a keh agugu reh, meh nati nga mboh aki mata a tuma na amya ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh amya, tswanza mya za nza ni mlana keh reh nehnehreh meh kǝ tuma na Ada amya ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sehreh reh, ta a sehreh andromboh ata huru nza a bleh ma amboh tufa mboh reh!<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Krumusu Ma Inza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Areh nza ka a trina reh, mya Ayohana meh gyuru nza ma huru anida anyi a vuruna ma inza. Agba ata mya nza ni sere nyi jiji reh a gohroh tswanza drumu, a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Ka ba na amya ma mareh, meh nati tsana noh andromboh ata nza a nati a bu dehreh kanga feh ma inyina ata areh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ma a huru heri Huru Nnoh ka a tamba ma ikpi amya, nimeh inza reh meh kǝ nza kpra Agohmoh anyi ata akyo anyi a tuma ma ikpi. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Kyangwri ata nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh, tohmoh a ŋoh a srehmehna tswanza kpakpa hungroh mboh, ata nza maka a fi la yasfa tasa karneliyan. Dadara anyi a srehmehna ata nza a tswanza kpakpa ata nza maka a fi la Zumurrudu, a goh kpra Agohmoh reh, <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Nza maka a goh kpra Agohmoh reh, kpra Agohmoh mboh reh amboh anyi agrumavoh ida afri a hwa anneh ma a yama, ata agbugba mboh agrumavoh ida afri a hwa anneh ma a tuma ma ikpi. Ma a were akuri atatasaa tasa za ma a bu na gbama ata kpakpa hungroh ma ikpi amoh mboh. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Zana tasa ryanza ka a leh a kate anyi ma kpra Agohmoh reh, sesenge tasa gohroh kpalala za ka a leh a kate anyi ma a huru. Ma tohmoh kpra Agohmoh reh, shira afitila atehrehkifi na anyi ma a leh a tuma a de, shira mboh nza ma a de a zana reh ma bu huru Nnoh mboh atehrehkifi na anyi. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Tasa za ma tomo kpra Agohmoh reh andromboh anyi a yama a tswanza fini glasi reh, a leh a gu iyo a tswanza amadubi ma nnoh reh</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Nza ma a goh kpra Agohmoh na mgba akanda mboh reh, awumu anyi aniye nza ma a bu na fene ma a yama, ma a gya iyo na mgba tomo tasa na mgba nyina. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ata jijii nimeh awumu amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene reh a tswanza gehgreh reh, ata na afri a tswanza ameh londo reh, ata na atatoh a bu na tomo a tswanza kyangwri, ata na anneh a tswanza angimi atsi hende ma avereh inza reh. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene reh, ma a bu na amgba atehrehkifi nambri ma amoh, ma a fira iyo mboh a gya a goh itoh amoh mboh reh nambri tasa ma hohroh amgba amoh mboh za. Na nnoh tasa nashi ni maka a sohroh ta kpa amumu kpeh mata ka bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">&lt;&lt;Zanana, Zanana, Zanana, Ada Nnoh ata nza a bu na wuwana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">A bu ŋoh tana a yama, a treh a bu ŋoh nehnehreh, a bu ŋoh ata nza a treh a nati a ba reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene reh, ma a leh a kpa amumu nga agba tasa ata rya sa, tasa za ma a kwende ma ŋoh ata nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh, ŋoh ata nza a nati a tuma atono za reh. Nza ma a lisa dehreh reh, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />agbugba mboh agrumavoh ida afri a hwa aniye reh maka a hwa a leh ma inzi ma tomo ŋoh ata nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh, tasa za maka a krumusu ŋoh ata nza a nati a tuma atono reh. Maka a fira gbama ikpi amoh mboh reh a gya a na ma tomo kpra Agohmoh reh. maka ariri la,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />&lt;&lt;Ada ambohroh tasa Nnoh ambohroh! ni tswa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">ti sa rya sa, tasa nga agba, tasa wuwana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">A bu noh ni lisa awumu mboh reh nambri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">tasa za tana a bu na kira anzoh za awumu mboh reh maka a yama na fene.<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Amgbasho Ata Gugununaa Tasa Ameh Atashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Meh nza amgbasho ata gugununa reh na ivoh rya a kpa akyo ata nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh. ma a hama na ŋa na mgba afri ma, tasa za ma a hama na hama mboh atehrehkifi na anyi. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Meh kǝ nza Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh agba anyi za, a leh a hehndeh ahwra a bleh na agba wuwa la, &lt;&lt;Anyi a nati a wina vasa hama mboh reh tasa za ta a vuru amgbasho ata gugununa reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Akyo anyi neh a sohroh a yama ma inza ha ma inzi, ha ma inziyo ata nza a nati a wina vuru amgbasho ata gugunuu reh ta a nza a na nimeh kpeh. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Meh kpanga nata tsifa la ma a sohroh a hunji akyo anyi ata nza a tswa ta a vuru amgbasho ata gugununa reh ta a nza a na nimeh kpeh. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Anyimbehreh nimeh agbugba mboh reh ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Kama kpanga kpeh. Nza! Gehgreh ata areh anyi ma alohsoh Yahuda, nza anyi ma chuhu Dawuda, kǝ shi keh agugu reh, a bu na wuwana ata nza a nati a wina vuru hama mboh atehrehkifi na anyi reh tasa za ta a vuru amgbasho ata gugununa reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Meh kǝ gyuru nza Ameh atashi anyi za a shi ma atsitsifi kpra Agohmoh tasa awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene tasa agbugba mboh reh. Atashi reh a shi tswanza ma a mla a kwo reh. A bu na atamaa atehrehkifi na anyi tasa iyo atehrehkifi na anyi, ata ma bu Huru Nnoh atehrehkifi na anyi nza ma a tohmoh a ba inziyo reh nambri. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Ameh atashi reh ka a na na a gu amgbasho ata gugununa reh nyi ma ivoh rya a kpa akyo ata nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Nza ka a sa amgbasho reh, awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh agrumavoh ida afri a hwa aniye reh maka a hwa ma tomo ameh atashi reh. Nambri ma amoh ma a de akroh anyi ngongo tasa awumu angǝshi na su nimeh gbugba ata kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwrii, wohroh reh a bu kwere Nnoh ata kyangwri Nnoh amboh zanana mboh reh. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Maka a leh a kpa amumu afeh ŋoh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">&lt;&lt;Ni tswa ti sa amgbasho ata gugununa reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ti vasa hama a ŋoh reh za.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Tama a mla nnoh a kwo, tasa za la imya anzoh a sa kyangwri mboh mata hunji nvara na Nnoh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">kyangwri amboh ata nza ma anyi alohsoh tasa arimi, tasa akpokpo afiyafiya mboh, tasa hungwa ha atisha mboh.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Ni lisa mboh mata bu kyangwri amboh ata Nnoh nza bu Agohmoh amoh, tasa za la ti bu noh firist amboh ata nza ma a krumusu ŋoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">tasa za ma a nati a de Agohmoh ma inziyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Mya meh gyuru nza za, meh kǝ sere agba mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh gaga, ma bu dubu gaga! Maka a shi a goh kpra Agohmoh tasa awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene reh, tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh reh za, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />maka a leh a kpa amumu na agba agba la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">&lt;&lt;Ameh atashi ata nza ma a mla a kwo reh a tswa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ta a sa wuwana ata de Agohmoh, asabara, lomo, tasa wuwana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">nga agba, ryasa tasa riri!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Meh sere awumu amboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa ma inza, tasa ma inzi tasa ata nza a bu ma hohroh inzi, tasa ata nza a bu nimeh fini agba reh, awumu amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene reh ma a leh a kpa amumu ka a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">&lt;&lt;Na ŋoh ata nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh tasa ameh atashi reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">riri tasa nga agba, tasa ryasa tasa wuwana ma a bu dehreh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">a gu a nati a tuma atono!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene reh maka kira la, &lt;&lt;Avoh dehreh!&gt;&gt; Agbugba mboh reh maka a hwa ma inzi a krumusu Nnoh tasa ameh atashi reh.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Hama Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Mya meh kǝ nza ameh atashi reh a vasa ta ka a vuru ata anyimbehreh nimeh hama mboh atehrehkifi na anyi reh, meh kǝ sehreh anyimbehreh nimeh awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene reh atsi bleh na agba agba tswanza kpalala la,&lt;&lt;Ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Mya nza kǝ nza reh, nyama atasaa anyi a yama ma a huru. Kyangwri ka nyama reh a de ita, maka nga ŋoh agamburu Agohmoh. A ka ma ikpi nyama reh a kate tswanza ŋoh ata nza a keh mgbiri kyangwri mboh reh wuwana.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ameh atashi reh ka a vasa ta ka a vuru hama ata afri reh; meh kǝ gyuru sehreh nimeh awumu amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene ata afri reh atsi bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Nyama anyi ka gyuru a kate za, A sha tasa ka nga nyiri. Kyangwri ka nyama wohroh reh ma nga ŋoh wuwana la ta a de mlana gofo a ba ma inziyo, la kyangwri mboh mata a leh a mla itoh amoh mboh a kwo. Maka nga ŋoh ambya gara agba.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ameh atashi reh ka a vasa ta ka a vuru hama ata atatoh reh; meh kǝ gyuru sehreh nimeh awumu amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene ata atatoh reh atsi bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ba!&gt;&gt; Meh were ayo meh kǝ nza Nyama ata hungwa anyi a yama ma a huru. Kyangwri ka nyama wohroh reh a bu na akloh tsara ma ivoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Meh kǝ sehreh andromboh anyi agohroh tswanza agba atsi kate nyi na awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene reh, a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Gbugba tsara yohroh alikama a tswa hungroh ndohmoh ata ibi anyimbehreh. Gbugba tsara atatoh ata yohroh baleh a tswa hungroh ndohmoh ata ibi anyimbehreh. Neh ti kama de amehneh agbeh akpehngeh tasa amwo inabi reh nasa kpeh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Ameh atashi reh ka a vasa ta ka a vuru hama ata na aniye reh; meh kǝ sehreh nimeh awumu amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene ata na aniye reh atsi bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Meh kǝ nza Nyama anyi a yama ma a huru za, a kasa hwasahwasa. Kyangwri ka nyama wohroh reh isa a ŋoh a bu kwo, tasa za atsi tuma amboh kwo mboh ma a leh a tufa ŋoh ma nyina. Maka nga mboh wuwana ma ikpi anyimbehreh nimeh aniye amboh ata nza ma a tuma ma inziyo reh, la mata a mla mboh a kwo ma atsi mlana gofo, inyo, bishi tasa agbugba iwoaye mboh.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Ameh atashi reh ka a vasa ta ka a vuru hama ata na atungu reh. Meh kǝ gyuru nza za ma hohroh bagadi reh, fene amboh ata nza ma a mla mboh a kwo tsifa la ma a leh ahwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh, tasa za la ma a leh a bleh mgbiri kyangwri mboh ma ikpi Nnoh tasa za la ma a bleh tsifa Nnoh reh yehlehleh <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Maka a leh a vuru agba agba a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ada ata nza a bu na wuwana nambri, a bu na zanana tasa za ka a bleh zizi! A nati a bu na ameh atamaa feh si hwra akpi ma amboh ata nza ma a bu ma inziyo reh, tasa za a nati bu na na ameh atamaa feh si nga iya ma amboh ata nza maka a mla reh a kwo reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Maka nga mboh zize akuri atatasaa nambri ma amoh, maka a bleh mboh la ma a tuma afo shidi, ma a nati a bana la mgbiri atohngoh amoh amboh te ndohmoh Nnoh tasa mboh amboh tufa mboh ma inziyo reh tama a kwo feh, tswanza mboh za nza ma a mla mboh a kwo reh.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Tasa za meh kǝ gyuru nza ameh atashi a vasa vuru hama ata atehrehkifi na anyi reh. Inzi ka a zuzuna a hwashina, nnoh ka a hungwa tswanza kuri kpanga kwo ata hungwa reh, nara za ka a gyuruna a tswanza imya reh. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Akpukpa mboh za maka a hwa a tamba a ba ma inzi, tswanza mara mgbungba amboh ata ma a hehreh abina kpeh nza maka a hwa a tamba anyi ma agbeh ameh ata inyo ka a zuzu reh. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Avereh inza ka lalana a bleh tswanza amgbasho ata gugunuu reh, maka a fufa agbohgboh mboh nambri tasa akpo inzi a tuhwara ma atsitsifi amwo ma atsi tuma amoh. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Agohgohmoh inziyo mboh, tasa amboh de Agohmoh mboh, tasa agbugba amboh de ita mboh, tasa amboh asabara mboh, tasa amboh wuwana mboh, tasa mgbiri kyangwri mboh, ahwra tasa amboh ata nza ma bu ahwra mboh kpeh reh, maka a huho ikpi amoh mboh ma hro mba tasa ma hohroh kpakpa mboh, tasa ma ikpi agbohgboh mboh. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Ma a leh a fi mba mboh tasa agbugba kpakpa mboh la, &lt;&lt;Hwa tamba nnoh ma ikpi ambohroh ti huho turoh nyi ma tomo ŋoh ata nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh, tasa gofo ameh atashi reh! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Ibi agba ata gofo amoh reh kǝ ba, a bu anyi a nati a wina a shi ta a leke?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Israila Mboh 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Areh nza ka a trina, meh kǝ nza mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh aniye ma a shi ma akachi inziyo reh na mgba aniye ma, ma a shi a de inyo mboh aniye ata inziyo reh, la inyo mboh reh mata kama afo inziyo ha fini agba ha agbeh mboh kpeh. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Meh kǝ gyuru nza Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi za a buti nyi mgba Nnoh nerebi a kate, a bu na hama Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene reh. A fi mara tohmoh Nnoh aniye reh, amboh ata Nnoh nza nga mboh wuwana ata mata a wina lofo inziyo tasa fini agba reh a vuru agba a kate. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kama de noh inziyo reh te nnoh abibi kpeh, ha fini agba, ha agbeh mboh, mbohroh meh nati gya kpra ma amboh ndohmoh Nnoh ambohroh ma gbomo amoh mboh tre fya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Maka a bleh meh la amboh ata nza ma a gya mboh hama Nnoh ma gbomo amoh mboh reh ma bu 144,000. Ma anyi alohsoh agrumavoh a hwa afri ta Israila mboh,<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Nza anyi alohsoh Yahuda reh ma a gya kpra ma kyangwri 12,000</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">Nza anyi na alohsoh Ruben reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">Nza anyi na alohsoh Gad reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Nza anyi na alohsoh Asher reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">Nza anyi na alohsoh Naftali reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">Nza anyi na alohsoh Manasse reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Nza anyi na alohsoh Semeyon reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">Nza anyi na alohsoh Alawi reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">Nza anyi na alohsoh Issaka reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Nza anyi na alohsoh Zebulun reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">Nza anyi na alohsoh Yusufu reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">Nza anyi na alohsoh Benyamin reh ma bu kyangwri 12,000.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duma Agba Ma A dohsohna anyi Akpokpo Atsifi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Areh nza ka a trina reh, meh were iyo meh kǝ nza duma agba amboh ata akyo a nati a wina bleh mboh a treh kpeh ma tohmoh amya. Ma a kate anyi akpokpo atsifi mboh ma atsetse, tasa alohsoh mboh tasa kyangwri mboh, tasa arimi mboh, ma a shi ma tohmoh kpra Agohmoh reh tasa ma tohmoh ameh atashi reh. Ma a were akuri atatasaa tasa za ma a de avuvu ahweh ma ivoh amoh mboh. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Maka a leh a vuru agba mama a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">&lt;&lt;Nvara reh anyi na Nnoh ambohroh mi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">ŋoh ata nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">tasa za anyi na ameh atashi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh nambri ma a shi a goh kpra Agohmoh reh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh tasa awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma bu na fene reh. Maka hwa susuna ma tohmoh kpra Agohmoh reh na tohmoh amoh mboh ma inzi, maka krumusu Nnoh, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />Maka a leh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">&lt;&lt;Avoh dehreh!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Riri tasa nga agba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">tasa lomo tasa kwende tasa rya sa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">wuwana ata de Agohmoh tasa wuwana ata itoh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">mata a bu Nnoh ambohroh ŋoh ata tuma atono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Avoh dehreh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Neh nimeh agbugba mboh reh anyi ka luhu meh la, &lt;&lt;Amboh ata nza ma a were zize akuri atatasaa mboh reh maka bu anyi mboh tasa za maka anyi ngbata?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Meh kǝ kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, meh wina kpeh, nnoh ni wina.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">A ka bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Amboh areh ma bu amboh ata nza ma a kate anyi nimeh iya agba reh, ma a hwara akuri amoh mboh na imya ameh atashi reh, maka a bu atatasaa ma nambri. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Nza ka bu dehreh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">&lt;&lt;Ma a bu ma tohmoh kpra Agohmoh reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">ma a leh a te ŋoh ndohmoh na nnoh tasa nashi ni nimeh afiya ŋoh;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">tasa za ŋoh ata nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh a nati a kehsheh mboh.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Inyo a nati a de mboh za kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">Yohroh amwo za a nati a de mboh za kpeh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">Nnoh a nati a hwene mboh za kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">Ha hwene shifo anyi ta afya mboh kpeh.<verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Tsifa la Ameh atashi ata nza a bu ma atsitsifi kpra Agohmoh reh a nati a sumu mboh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">a nati a de mboh a na na amwo ata nza a nati nga mboh fene reh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">Tasa za Nnoh a nati a firu mwueneh anyi ma tohmoh amoh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ameh Atashi A vuru Hama Ata Na atehrehkifi na Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Ameh atashi nza ka a vuru hama ata na atehrehkifi na anyi ŋoh reh, inza maka a tuma shatata a gu hwashi nnoh anyimbehreh. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Neh meh kǝ nza amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na atehrehkifi na anyi ŋoh ata nza a shi ma tohmoh Nnoh, tasa maka nga mboh akpigri atehrehkifi na anyi.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi, ka ba ba a shi ma tohmoh bagadi ata nza maka afya amehneh nyungo, a buti shi de gbugba kpakpa hungroh atasaa ata amehneh nyungo fya. Maka nga ŋoh amehneh nyungo gaga, la ta a mishi na ata kwere amboh kyangwri Nnoh mboh nambri ma ikpi bagadi ata kpakpa hungroh ahungwri ata nza a bu ma tomo ikpi kpra agba reh. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Anzoh angǝshi fya amehneh nyungo reh, tasa kwere Nnoh mboh reh ka a hinga anyi ma ivoh amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh a ka a na ma tomo Nnoh. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Neh amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a gu soso gbugba fya amehneh nyungo reh, ta ka a gya were shira na su nyi ma bagadi reh, ta ka a shebiri a ba ma Inziyo. Gohroh atsifi ka a yama mboh tasa Kpalala mboh maka ahwra, tasa rya a nza, tasa zuzuna inziyo.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Drumu Mboh reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Neh Mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh amboh ata nza ma a bu na drumu mboh atehrehkifi na anyi reh, maka a shi a bana mata a wri mboh.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata jiji ŋoh reh ka a wri drumu a ŋoh. Talala tasa ishira maka a te, a dohsohna na imya, maka a sangrana a tamba a ba ma inziyo, shira reh ka afya mgba anyimbehreh nimeh atatoh reh, tasa agbeh mboh tasa amgba bini anunu mboh reh nambri.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Neh amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na afri reh ka a wri drumu a ŋoh. Andromboh anyi ka a kate a tswanza mba agba, a buti fya ishira, maka shebiri ŋoh a na nimeh fini agba. Anyimbehreh nimeh amwo atatoh ata fini agba reh, ka a gyuruna a te imya. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Hwashi ata na atatoh nimeh awumu amboh nza ma a yama nimeh amwo amboh nza ma a bu na fene reh maka a kwo, tasa hwashi ata na atatoh nimeh gbogblondo amwo mboh reh maka a lofona.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Neh amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na atatoh ŋoh ka a wri drumu a ŋoh reh. Maka a nza akpukpa agba anyi ata nza kpanga a zana a tswanza shira tochi reh, ka a tamba anyi avereh a hwa a na na mgba hwashi ata na atatoh ata fini mboh reh, tasa na mgba hwashi ata na atatoh ŋoh atsi amwo nza ka a kate anyi reh. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Isa akpukpa reh la, &lt;&lt;Gbiriri&gt;&gt; Hwashi mgba anyi ata na atatoh ŋoh ata amwo reh ka gyuruna a te gbiriri, kyangwri mboh gaga nza ma a wa amwo reh maka a kwo tsifa ata amwo nza a te gbiriri reh.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Neh amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na anneh reh ka a wri drumu a ŋoh reh. Maka ava hwashi mgba anyi ata na atatoh ata Nnoh, tasa hwashi mgba anyi ata na atatoh a ŋoh ata nara, tasa za hwashi mgba anyi ata akpukpa mboh, la mata a za a zana za kpeh, izana a za a yama na mgba hwashi anyi ata na atatoh ŋoh ata ibi, ha na ata shini reh kpeh.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Neh Meh kǝ nza, tasa meh kǝ sehreh angimi atsi kpanga a gǝga na agba mama ma inza la, iya agba! iya agba Iya agba a nati a ba meh ikpi amohnoh amboh tuma noh meh inziyo reh, na ameh ata nza ma a nati a wri drumu ata mgbiri mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh atatoh nza ma a shi a bana mata a wri reh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na atungu ka a wri drumu ŋoh reh. Meh kǝ nza akpukpa ata ta ka a hwa a tamba a ba ma inziyo reh, akyo anyi ka a nga ma akpukpa reh, akroh vuru itsiyo agba reh. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Akpukpa reh ka a vuru itsiyo agba reh, anzoh anyi nza ka kate nyi nimeh ka a tswanza la ma yaha kari reh, inzo reh ka a hama nnoh tasa ka a de avereh inza reh a hwa shini. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Itawa mboh maka a kate anyi nimeh anzoh reh a tamba a ba ma inziyo, maka a nga mboh wuwana dafa ika ata ina mboh reh. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Maka bleh mboh la ma a kama a te andromboh ma bini mboh kpeh ha mata a bara agbeh mboh kpeh ha la mata a bara mehreh mbeh andromboh anyi kpeh, la maka ta ka a bu kyangwri ma amboh ata nza ma a bu na kpra Nnoh ma gbomo amoh mboh kpeh. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Itawa mboh reh ma a sohroh a bleh mboh la mata a mla kyangwri mboh reh a kwo kpeh, neh la tama a nga mboh iya ma ma anara atungu. Rina a ŋoh reh a tswanza a bu rina da ata nna reh. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Nimeh anara atungu reh kyangwri mboh reh ma a nati fa la mata a kwo, neh ma a nata a hunji kpeh; mata a nati kira la mboh mata a kwo, neh kwo a nati leke ta a ba mboh.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Itawa mboh reh ma a gu tohmoh nyama mboh, amboh nza ma a buti shi a bana mata a na amoh gofo, ma a bu na andromboh amboh anyi tswanza gbama ikpi ikata kpakpa hungroh, tasa tohmoh amoh mboh a tswanza ata kyangwri mboh amoh. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Shina amoh mboh reh a tswanza la bu shina ifiya mboh reh, anyini amoh mboh reh a tswanza la a bu anyini gehgreh mboh amoh reh. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Ma a hama agboh agohsoh amoh mboh reh na andromboh anyi a tswanza la a bu akuri karafi hungwa ŋoh reh, amgba amoh mboh a gohroh a tswanza la a bu itsu vara nyama mboh amboh kama akroh ka na amoh atsi gofo reh. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Ma a bu na ziyumu tasa maka ada tswanza ina reh, tasa za a bu ma ziyumu amoh reh ma a nati a bu na wuwana nga bishi ma kyangwri mboh a gu na a te anara atungu. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Ma a bu na Agohmoh ata nza a de mboh reh, ŋoh reh a bu amehreh tohmoh ata nza a de itsiyo agba ata nza aniye reh. Isa a ŋoh na mgba Ibraniyawa mboh reh a bu Abaddon, na mgba Heleniyawa mboh reh a bu Afoliyo (lomo isa reh a bu &lt;&lt;Lofona&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Wa iya ata jiji reh kǝ gǝga; neh ka a treh ka a hwa iya amboh afri ma a treh a ba.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Neh amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na atehrehkifi ŋoh ka a wri drumu a ŋoh. Meh kǝ sere agba nyi na mgba aniye ata bagadi ata kpakpa hungroh reh, nza a shi ma ma tomo Nnoh reh. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Agba reh ka a bleh ma amehreh tohmoh ata atehrehkifi reh la, &lt;&lt;Hingre nnoh mara tohmoh mboh anneh reh amboh ata nza ma a lafa mboh ma amwo agba Yufiretis reh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Maka a hingre mara tohmoh mboh anneh reh; na ameh wohroh ma ibi wohroh ma nara wohroh tasa ma ahushi tama a gya mboh a shi bana la, mata a mla hwashi atatoh ata kyangwri mboh a kwo. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Meh kǝ nza amboh de ita mboh vara agba ma ikpi nyama mboh: ma a bleh meh la ma bu gaga a tswa atsi bu 200,000,000. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Tasa meh kǝ nza nimeh huru amya la nyama mboh reh tasa amboh ka mboh reh ma were akuri karafi ata amwo atishaa nza a tswanza shira reh, tasa ata amwo bula nza tswanza bu amwo safaya reh, tasa za a bu na amwo asubeh. Ikpikpi nyama mboh reh ma a tswanza ikpi gehgreh reh, ishira tasa anzoh tasa abi shira ata nyungo maka a kate anyi ma aniye amoh mboh. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Na adamwa ata areh ma a mla kyangwri mboh hwashi anyimbehreh nimeh atatoh a kwo, ka a bu na ishira tasa anzoh tasa abi shira ata nyungo ata nza kate a nyi ma aniye nyama mboh reh. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Wuwana nyama mboh reh a bu ma aniye amoh tasa za a bu mba iziyumu amoh. iziyumu amoh reh neh a tswanza la a bu iyo mboh amboh nza a bu na ikpi reh, maka a te ndohmoh na wohroh ka nyungwa kyangwri mboh a te bla.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Mgbiri kyangwri mboh amboh ata adamwa reh nza a sohroh a mla mboh a kwo kpeh reh, ma a leke mata a gyuruna a yi aki andromboh mboh nza ma a lisa na ivoh amoh reh ata kpeh. Ka a bu la, ma a sohroh a yi krumusu agugu reh ata kpeh, ma a sohroh a yi aki tufa agboto mboh amboh ata nza ma a lisa mboh na kpakpa hungroh atasaa, ha kpakpa hungroh ahungwri ha na kpakpa hungroh atisha, ha na a zizi kpakpa, ha na agbeh, amboh ata nza ma a nza kpeh, ha mata a sehreh, ha la mata a hehndeh. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Ha la mata a gyuruna a yi akeki hende mla kyangwri mboh kwo reh ata, aki lisa yereri amoh mboh, aki hende leh ahohndoh amoh mboh, ha aki hende te ayuhu amoh mboh.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Amehreh Tohmoh Tasa Ameh Amgbasho Ata Gununa Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Neh meh kǝ nza amehreh tohmoh Nnoh agba a ŋoh anyi atsi kate tamba anyi ma inza. Avereh ka a hama ŋoh tasa dadara ka a goh ikpi a ŋoh; tomo ŋoh ka a tswanza noh reh, hwana ŋoh mboh ka a tswanza a bu ingri shira reh. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Tana a vuru ameh amgbasho ata gunuu reh ma ivoh a ŋoh. Ka a gya ambasa hwana rya a kpa a ŋoh a na ma fini agba ta ka a gya ata a mina a ŋoh a na ma inzi, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />ta ka a fi na agba mama ata nza agohroh tswanza la a bu kpanga Gehgreh mboh reh. nza ka a fi a treh reh, kpalala mboh atehrehkifi na anyi maka a kira ŋoh ka a vuru agba. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Kpalala mboh atehrehkifi na anyi nza ma ka atsifa reh, meh kǝ nati ŋa. Neh meh kǝ sehreh agba tsifa anyi ma inza la, &lt;&lt;Andromboh ata kpalala mboh atehrehkifi na anyi nza ma ahwra a bleh reh, hama tsehe, kama ŋa kpeh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Neh Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata mya nza ni nza atsi a shi ma ikpi fini agba tasa ma ikpi inzi reh, ka a gu ivoh rya a kpa ŋoh a ka inza, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />ta ka a gu faku nimeh isa Nnoh, ata nza a bu na fene ata tuma atono reh, ŋoh ata nza a lisa inza tasa inzi tasa fini agba, tasa awumu mboh nza ma a bu nimeh reh. Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ameh a za a treh a yama kpeh! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Neh na ameh ata amehreh tohmoh ata na atehrehkifi na anyi nza a nati a wri drumu a ŋoh reh, Nnoh a nati a lisa andromboh ata ŋoh ta ka a lisa a gya ma huho ŋoh reh, tswanza ta ka a bleh ma ahwra a ŋoh mboh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Neh meh kǝ sehreh agba ata meh ti kǝ sehreh reh a gyuru a bleh meh za la, &lt;&lt;Na ni sa amgbasho ata nza a bu vuruu ma ivoh amehreh tohmoh ata nza a shi ma ikpi fini agba tasa ma inzi reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Meh kǝ na na Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh meh kǝ bleh ŋoh la, ta nga meh amgbasho akehreh ŋoh reh. ŋoh ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Sa ti rya, a nati te nnoh jwa ma yira anzoh, ma niye anzoh neh a nati a bu na nana tswanza itoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Meh kǝ sa amgbasho akehreh reh nyi ma ivoh ŋoh, meh kǝ rya mina, neh a ka a nana ma aniye tswanza itoh reh, nza meh kǝ mina tre neh, ka a gyuruna a te jwa nimeh yira amya. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Neh maka a gyuru a bleh meh za la, &lt;&lt;Ni nati sa tsifa Nnoh reh bleh ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a nati a hunji kyangwri ma akpokpo atsifi mboh, tasa sene mboh ma atsetse, tasa arimi mboh tasa agohgohmoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Amboh Nza Mata A bleh Mboh Afri Ata Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh tana nga meh ikpoh anyi ata nza a tswa nza ikpoh tsara reh, a ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Na ti tsara ida Nnoh reh tasa bagadi reh, ti bleh nza amboh ata nza ma a leh krumusu nimeh reh. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Neh ti kama tsara mgba inziyo ida Nnoh reh kpeh, ta atsi wohroh tsehe, tsifa la ma a gu atsi wohroh reh a nga amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. Ma a nati a huhuya akpo afiya agba ata nza a bu na zanana reh a gu anara agrumavoh ida anneh a hwa afri. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Meh nati tohmoh amboh bleh ma ikpi amya mboh afri nza ma a were akuri kpanga kwo reh, meh nati nga mboh wuwana mata a bleh tsifa Nnoh reh nimeh ibi 1,260&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Amboh ble ma ikpi amya mboh afri reh, ma bu agbeh akpehngeh afri, tasa ikpoh kohhroh shira afri ata nza ma a shi ma tomo Nnoh ata nza a bu Ada ata inziyo <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Nza akyo anyi a kira ta a lisa mboh andromboh abibi, shira a nati a kate anyi ma aniye amoh ta a lofo amboh ata ma a fi mboh ma tohmoh reh, ma aki wohroh za, akyo ata nza a nati a lisa mboh andromboh abibi reh, ma a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Ma a bu na wuwana ata ma a nati a wina ha awi ma avereh inza la ta a sohroh a ba kpeh, a gu anyi ameh ata nza ma a buti bleh andromboh ata nza ma sehreh a nyi na Nnoh reh. Ma bu na wuwana za ata ma a nati a wina de amwo mboh ma inzi mata a te imya, tasa za ma a bu na wuwana ata ma a nati wina de abibi bishi mboh a ba ma inziyo areh ameh ata ma a kira reh.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Nza maka ahwra tsifa amoh reh a treh, iwoaye ata nza a kate anyi nimeh itsiyo agba reh, a ba atsi mla na na amoh. A nati a mla mboh a keh tasa za ta a mla mboh kwo, <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Kohmoh amoh mboh ma a nati a leh ma aki agba ata akpo afiya agba reh, ata tama ka a kpa Ada amoh ma gbohrohgboh reh, ma a fi akpo afiya agba reh na kpra isa ata huru la Sodom, ha Masar. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Kyangwri mboh ma anyi akpokpo atsifi, tasa arimi mboh tasa alohsoh mboh ma a nati a nza kohmoh amoh mboh a gu ibi atatoh na mgbiri, ma a nati a kira la mata anyifo mboh nimeh ikpi nyifo kpeh. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Kyangwri mboh nza ma a yama ma inziyo reh, ma a nati a johjoh na kwo kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh mboh afri reh, ma a nati a kira mata a de ngǝnga mboh a gafa ma itoh amoh, tsifa la kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh mboh afri reh tama a de iya agba a ba ma inziyo. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ibi atatoh na mgbiri nza ka a gǝga reh neh, inyo ata ka a de fene a ba, anyi na Nnoh reh ka a ba ba aniye mboh, maka a de a hinga a shi, amboh ata nza ma a nza mboh reh maka a nyiri gaga. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh mboh afri reh maka a gyuru a sehreh agba anyi yivoh ma inza a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kate ba nnoh na amya ma mareh!&gt;&gt; Maka a ka a na amoh inza ma avereh, amboh ata ma a fi mboh ma tomo reh maka a shi a nza mboh a ka. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Ma a huru heri inzi ka a zuzuna, hwashi akpo afiya agba reh anyimbehreh nimeh agrumavoh ka a druhuna, kyangwri dubu atehrehkifi na anyi maka a lofona. Mgbiri kyangwri mboh reh maka nyiri maka riri isa Nnoh agba ata nza a yama ma inza reh.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Iya agba ata na afri reh kǝ gǝga, ata na atatoh neh wa a nati ka ba, a nati a yanda kpeh.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Drumu Ata Atehrehkifi na Anyi reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na atehrehkifi na anyi ka wri drumu a ŋoh, maka a sehreh agba amboh anyi ma inza atsi bleh la, &lt;&lt;Wuwana ata de kpra Agohmoh ata inziyo areh kǝ bu kpra Agohmoh ata Ada ambohroh tasa ata Kristi a ŋoh, tasa za a bu ŋoh a nati a de Agohmoh ata tuma atono. <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Agbugba kyangwri mboh agrumavoh dida afri a hwa anneh amboh ata nza ma tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh amoh reh ma tomo Nnoh, ma hwa a leh ma inzi na tomo a krumusu Nnoh, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />ma bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Ada Nnoh agba, nnoh ata nza ni yama nehnehreh, tasa za tini yama na kpikpi za,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Meh kwende Nnoh tsifa la ni gu wuwana anzoh ata nza bu agba reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">ni kǝ tre de Agohmoh nehnehreh.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh ma a te gofo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">tsifa la ameh gofo anzoh kǝ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ameh ata ma a nati ahwra akpi ma kunu mboh za kǝ ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ameh kǝ ba za ata ma a nati a nga firoh ma ahwra anzoh mboh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">tasa kyangwri anzoh mboh amboh nambri, amboh ata nza ma a nyiri isa anzoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">amehreh akehreh ha kyangwri agba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ameh kǝ ba ata ma a nati a lofo amboh ata nza ma a lofo inziyo reh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Maka a vuru ida Nnoh ma inza, maka a nza akwati ata tsifa bleh gya a ŋoh za nimeh ida reh. Atsifi ka a leh aryanza, tasa gohroh, tasa kpalala, tasa inzi ka a zuzuna, tasa agbugba talala mboh.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Afiya Anyi Tasa Iyoh Agba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Meh nza Kpra awumu ŋara aniye nyiri a kate ma avereh inza. Afiya anyi a were nnoh a hama itoh a ŋoh tswanza kuri reh. Nara a bu ma hohroh hwana ŋoh, gbama ikpi a ŋoh reh a bu na akpukpa agrumavoh a hwa afri. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />A bu na ivru, mara waka a ba ŋoh whiri, a ka a kpanga a kate tsifa rina ata mara reh.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Meh nza kpra anyi za ata nga nyiri a kate anyi ma avereh inza. Iyoh agba atisha anyi a bu na Ikpikpi atehrehkifi na anyi, tasa atamaa agrumavoh, tasa za gbama a yama ma Ikpikpi mboh reh. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Iyoh reh akpi akpukpa mboh reh avavara anyimbehreh nimeh atatoh na ziyumu a ŋoh, anyi ma avereh inza reh a tamba a ba ma inzi. Ka a shi ma tomo afiya reh la nza afiya reh tana a mara ŋoh ta a rya amehreh reh. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Afiya reh ka a mara amehreh atsifa, a bu ŋoh wohroh nza a nati a de Agohmoh kyangwri mboh ma inziyo na ikpoh karafi reh. Amehreh reh maka a sa ŋoh a hwana a na ni Nnoh ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Afiya reh ka a gbo a na ŋoh inzi a tuhwara, atsi ata Nnoh nza a lisa a gya ŋoh reh, ma a nati a leh a sumu ŋoh ma a huru a gu ibi 1,260<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Gofo ka a hinga ma inza, Mikailu mboh ma mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh maka a mla na na iyo reh, iyo reh za ma bu mboh ma mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh maka a leh a mla na na amoh; <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />iyo reh neh maka a keh wuwana a ŋoh, ŋoh tasa mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh maka a katsi mboh na tuma ma inza anyi avoh wohroh. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Maka a gu iyo agba reh a shebiri ma inzi, iyoh ata kiri reh nza maka ka a fi ŋoh la agugu ha Shetan, ŋoh ata nza a landa inziyo reh na agba ma. Tama a gu ŋoh a shebiri ma inziyo reh mboh ma mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Meh kǝ sehreh agba yivoh anyi ma inza la, &lt;&lt;Nehnehreh nvara Nnoh kǝ ba, nehnehreh Nnoh kǝ tsana wuwana a ŋoh tswanza Agohmoh! nehnehreh Kristi za kǝ tsana wuwana a ŋoh kate! Tsifa la akyo ata ta ka a leh a shi ma tomo Nnoh a leh a kya amboh tufa mboh na tutu reh kǝ ta inza. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Ma a keh wuwana a ŋoh na imya ameh atashi reh, tasa za na tsifa ata a zizi ŋoh nza ma a leh a bleh reh; tasa za ma a kira na fene amoh kpeh la mata a kwo. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Nza a bu dehreh reh mohnoh amboh ata nza ni yama nnoh ma inza reh ti johjoh nnoh! Inziyo tasa fini agba neh ma aniye nimeh iya agba! Tsifa agugu reh kǝ ba na amohnoh, a bu na gofo gaga, tsifa la a wina ameh a ŋoh kǝ hwa shidi ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Iyoh reh nza ka a nza la ma a gu ŋoh a tavoh a ba ma inziyo reh, a ka a jiji a leh a katsi afiya ata nza a mara amehreh atsifa reh a tufa. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Maka a nga ma afiya reh amgba afri ata angimi agba la ta a zohhoh ŋoh atsi hinga a na a ŋoh inzi a tuhwara reh, atsi ata ma a nati a sumu ŋoh a gu ahushi atatoh na mgbiri, la iyoh reh ta za a hunji ŋoh za kpeh. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Nza ka a bu dehreh reh, iyoh reh ka a sangra amwo a kate anyi ma aniye a ŋoh reh, la amwo reh ta a gu afiya reh. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Inziyo reh neh ka a shingi afiya reh; Inziyo ka a vuru aniye a ŋoh ta ka a mina amwo ata nza a kate anyi ma aniye iyoh reh. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Iyoh reh ka a te gofo gaga na afya reh, a ka a na la ŋoh ta a na na a mla na na mgbiri alohsoh afya mboh reh, mboh amboh ata nza ma a tufa akpi Nnoh reh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a shi ma ikpi tsifa Yeso ata a zizi ata Yeso nza a vuru a tsana reh. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Iyo reh ka a shi ma ikpi asehngeh ma akachi fini akre.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Iwoaye Afri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Meh nza iwoaye anyi a buti kate anyi ma fini akre. A bu na atamaa agrumavoh tasa ikpikpi atehrehkifi na anyi, atamaa mboh reh ma a bu na gbama ata Agohmoh nambri ma amoh, ma kpikpi mboh reh nambri ma a gya isa ata a kya Nnoh. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Iwoaye ata mya nza ni nza reh a tswanza ukwo, hwana a ŋoh mboh a tswanza iwoaye anyi nza maka a fi la achi tasa za aniye ŋoh a tswanza aniye gehgreh reh. Iyo agba reh ka nga ma iwoaye reh wuwana a ŋoh tasa kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh, tasa wuwana a ŋoh ata de atsifi agba reh. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Ikpi iwoaye reh anyimbehreh a tswanza a bu na ibla agba reh, ibla reh neh kǝ bleh. Inziyo na agba ma maka a shi a nza a ŋara aniye ma maka a tufa iwoaye reh. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka a krumusu iyoh agba reh, tsifa la ŋoh kǝ nga wuwana a ŋoh ma iwoaye reh. Maka a krumusu iwoaye reh za maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu anyi a tswanza iwoaye ata areh? A bu anyi nza a nati a wina shi ta a mla na na a ŋoh reh?<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Iwoaye reh ma nga ŋoh aniye ata ka a leh atsifa a gu ikpi a ka ma inza tasa tsifa a kya Nnoh, maka a nga ŋoh aki la ta a tsana wuwana ata nara agrumavoh dida anneh a hwa afri. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />A ka a jiji a leh a kya Nnoh, a kya isa a ŋoh za tasa atsi tuma a ŋoh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu na tuma ma inza reh nambri. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Maka a nga ma iwoaye reh kira la ta a na na a mla na na kyangwri Nnoh mboh, mboh reh ta a mla mboh a keh, tasa za ma nga ŋoh wuwana anyi ata de arimi mboh, tasa akpokpo atsifi mboh, tasa achifi mboh. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Kyangwri mboh nambri nza ma a bu ma inziyo areh ma a nati a krumusu iwoaye agba reh, kyangwri amboh ata neh ma ta ka a jiji a ŋa isa amoh neh ma a hehreh a lisa inziyo kpeh reh, nimeh amgbasho ata fene nza a bu ata ameh atashi ŋoh reh, ata maka a mla a kwo reh. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />&lt;&lt;Sehreh, akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sehreh reh, ta a sehreh!<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Akyo ata nza ma a nati a de ŋoh ta bu ahwra reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">a nati bu ahwra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Akyo ata nza ma la ma a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo na ambya gara reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">a bu ambya gara a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo zizi.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Ata areh a kira de ikpi ahroh tasa nga agohsoh na kyangwri Nnoh mboh<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Meh gyuru nza iwoaye anyi za, ata nza a kate anyi ma inzi. A bu na atamaa afri tswanza ata ameh atashi a ŋoh reh, atsifa tswanza iyoh reh. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />A te ndohmoh na wuwana iwoaye ata jiji reh ma tomo a ŋoh. A de inziyo reh tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu ma inziyo na wuwana la mata a krumusu iwoaye ata jiji reh, iwoaye ata ibla a ŋoh kǝ bleh reh. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Iwoaye ata na afri reh a lisa kpra agbugba awumu ata shi nza ŋara aniye ma, a lisa shira a tamba anyi ma inza a ba inziyo ma tomo kyangwri mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Iwoaye ata na afri reh ka a landa kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu ma inziyo reh nambri, ma aki tsana kpra awumu shi nza ŋara aniye a ŋoh mboh reh, ata nza ma a kira ŋoh la ta a lisa ma tomo iwoaye ata jiji reh. Iwoaye reh ka a bleh mboh la tama a mina yafa anyi la mata nga agba ma iwoaye ata ma ta ka a mla ŋoh a gya bla na ambya gara ta a gyuru a hunji fene yama reh. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Nnoh a nga kira ma iwoaye ata na afri reh la ta afo fene ma yafa iwoaye ata jiji reh, yafa reh a wina tsifa, tasa za a nati a mla kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a leke mata krumusu ŋoh reh a kwo. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Woaye reh a de kyangwri mboh na wuwana la mata a sa lamba reh ma ivoh rya a kpa amoh ha ma gbomo amoh, agbugba tasa akǝkehreh, amboh asabara tasa amboh iya mboh, ahwra tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu ahwra mboh kpeh. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Akyo ata nza a bu na kpra lamba reh kpeh a nati a wina sa ha ta a rifa andromboh kpeh, kpra reh a tsana isa iwoaye reh ha lamba ata nza a tsana yafa isa a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Andromboh ata areh a kira akyo ata nza a bu na lomo. Akyo ata nza a bu na nza wina reh, a nati a wina nza ta a bleh lomo lamba iwoaye reh, lamba reh a bu ata isa kyangwri. Lamba reh a bu 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Ameh Atashi tasa Kyangwri A ŋoh mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Meh were iyo neh, meh kǝ nza ameh atashi a shi ma ikpi agbohgboh Sihiyona, kyangwri mboh 144,000 ma bu mboh ma a ŋoh, ma a ŋa isa ameh atashi reh tasa isa alehmeh ma ikpi gbomo amoh mboh. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Meh kǝ sehreh agba anyi ma inza a tswanza gohroh amwo atsi gbo reh, agohroh gaga a tswanza kpalala reh, agba ata mya nza ni sehreh reh a tswanza ata amboh mini ngohngoh mboh ma a leh a mini ngohngoh amoh. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Kyangwri mboh 144,000 reh ma a shi ma tomwo kpra Agohmoh tasa za ma tomwo awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene reh, tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh; ma a leh a kpa amumu afeh, a bu mboh tsimoh nza ma a nati a wina kpehkpehteh amumu reh. A bu guma amboh wohroh nza ma a nati a gyuru a sa agba amoh mboh anyi ma inziyo reh. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Kyangwri amboh areh ma a de ikpi amoh na zanana, ma a hehreh a kputu itoh amoh atsi leh ahohndoh na ifiya mboh kpeh. Ma a leh a tufa ameh atashi a na atsi ata nza a nati a na reh. Mboh reh ma a gyuru a sa mboh a hwana anyi na mgbiri kyangwri mboh, tasa za a bu mboh amboh ata nza ma a nati a jiji a fira mboh nga Nnoh tasa ameh atashi reh. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Ma a hehreh a bleh huru tsifa ma aniye amoh mboh kpeh; mboh reh ma a hehreh a lisa andromboh abibi kpeh.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mara Tohmoh Nnoh Mboh Atatoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Meh kǝ nza Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi atsi hende na amgba ma avereh inza, a bu na tsifa nana ata tuma atono, a hehndeh ahwra a bleh ma kyangwri mboh ma inziyo, tasa kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu achifi mboh tasa alohsoh mboh tasa arimi mboh, tasa akpokpo afiyafiya mboh. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />A ka a vuru agba mama a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nga noh agba ma Nnoh, tasa ti riri nnoh agba a ŋoh za! Ameh hwra akpi a ŋoh ma kyangwri mboh nambri reh kǝ ba. Krumusu nnoh akyo ata nza a lisa inza tasa inziyo, tasa fini akre mboh, tasa amwo ata nza ka a kate anyi ma inzi mboh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi ata na afri za ka a tufa ata jiji reh, a ka a leh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kǝ hwa! Babila agba reh kǝ hwa! Ŋoh ata nza a lisa kyangwri mboh na agba ma la mata a wa amwo inabi, amwo inabi ata nza a wuwana reh a de mboh a te abibi atsi hende leh ahohndoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na atatoh anyi za ka a tufa ata jijii tasa ata na afri reh, a ka a vuru agba yivoh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza krumusu iwoaye reh tasa yafa a ŋoh tasa za la ta a sa kpra ma ikpi gbomo a ŋoh ha ma ambasa ivoh ŋoh, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />mboh na ikpi amoh ma a nati a wa amwo inabi Nnoh, ata gofo Nnoh ata nza fya reh, amboh ata nza ma a lisa na wuwana a ŋoh nimeh kofu gofo Nnoh reh. Ma a nati nga ŋoh iya veve kpeh na shira agba ata ka fya nyungo ma tomo mara tohmoh Nnoh amboh zanana mboh tasa Ameh atashi <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Inzo shira ata nza a nati a leh nga mboh iya reh, a nati a ka a na ma inza ata tuma atono. Kukuna a nati a yama na nnoh ha nashi ni ma amboh ata nza ma krumusu iwoaye tasa yafa a ŋoh reh kpeh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a sa kpra isa a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ata areh a kira de ikpi ahroh ata kyangwri Nnoh mboh, tasa amboh ata nza ma Nga agohsoh amoh na akpi Nnoh, tasa za maka a lisa yehlehleh ma Yeso.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Meh kǝ gyuru sehreh agba anyi ma inza la, &lt;&lt;Ŋa awumu amboh areh: Te atoh a bu na kyangwri amboh ata ma a nati a kwo nimeh Ada a gu anyi nehnehreh!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">&lt;&lt;Haa&gt;&gt; Huru reh ka a bleh dehreh. &lt;&lt;Ma a nati afo anyi ma iya ata ndohmoh amoh reh, tsifa la firoh ndohmoh amoh reh a nati a tufa mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fasa Ata Inziyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Meh were iyo meh kǝ nza, avereh atasaa, andromboh anyi a tswanza Amehreh kyangwri a tuma ma avereh reh, a bu na gbama ikpi ata kpakpa hungroh ma ikpi a ŋoh, tasa za a bu na Ambya fasa awumu ata nza a rya veve kpeh ma ivoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi za ka a kate anyi ida Nnoh, a ka a fi kyangwri ata nza a tuma ma avereh reh na agba agba la, &lt;&lt;Gu ambya fasa awumu anzoh ti fasa awumu reh, la ameh fasa reh kǝ ba; awumu inziyo reh kǝ bina tswa na fasa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Ŋoh ata nza a tuma ma ikpi avereh reh ka a shebiri ambya fasa awumu a ŋoh reh a na ma inziyo, ka a fasa inziyo reh.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Neh meh kǝ nza Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi za ka a gyuru a kate anyi ma ida Nnoh ata inza reh, ŋoh za a bu na ambya fasa awumu ata nza a rya veve kpeh reh. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh anyi a bu na wuwana ma ikpi shira a gyuru a kate anyi ma bagadi a ba za, A ka a vuru agba agba a bleh ma Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata nza a de ambya rya reh la, &lt;&lt;Gu ambya anzoh reh te ndohmoh na wohroh ma aye, ti fa icha mara agbeh inabi ata nza a bu ma aye inabi ata inziyo reh, la maraa mboh reh ma abina.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a gu ambya a ŋoh reh a shebiri a na ma inziyo, a ka a fa mara inabi anyi ma agbeh inabi reh, a ka a fira mboh a were a na ma akroh firu mara agbeh inabi ata gofo abibi Nnoh reh. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Maka a firu mara inabi reh ma mgba inziyo, imya ka a leh a kate anyi ma atsi ata maka a firu mara agbeh inabi reh, nza ma a tsara na ikpoh tsara reh, izeh a ŋoh a nati a bu kilomita deri atatoh, tasa za iniye ŋoh a bu hwana atungu.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mara Tohmoh Nnoh mboh na bishi abibi Ata trinaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Meh kǝ gyuru nza kpra anyi za ma inza, ata nza bu agba tasa a bu ata ŋara aniye. Mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh atehrehkifi na anyi, ma a bu na bishi abibi atehrehkifi na anyi, amboh wohroh reh ma bu bishi abibi ata trinaa, ata ma a nati a tsana gofo Nnoh ata trinaa reh<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Meh kǝ were iyo meh kǝ nza andromboh anyi a tswanza fini kpakpa gu iyo reh a mishi mboh ma shira. Meh kǝ gyuru nza amboh ata nza ma a shi a mla na na iwoaye a keh reh tasa yafa a ŋoh reh, tasa ata isa a ŋoh nza bu anomba reh, ma a shi ma aniye glasi reh, ma a shi a de ngohngoh mboh ata Nnoh nza a nga mboh reh, <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />maka a leh a kpa amumu Musa, nza a bu ahwra Nnoh reh, tasa amumu ameh atashi reh a leh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">&lt;&lt;Ada Nnoh ata nza a bu na wuwana reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">ndohmoh anzoh mboh reh ma a bu agbugba nambri, tasa za maka a de shi nza ŋara aniye a ba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Agohmoh kyangwri mboh nambri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Akeki anzoh mboh reh ma a bu yehlehleh tasa za aki Nnoh ma bu zizi!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ada, a bu anyi ata nza a nati a nyiri nnoh kpeh reh?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">A bu anyi ata nza a nati a leke ta a bleh isa anzoh reh?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">A bu noh tsinzo ni bu Nnoh ata zanana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Akpokpo atsifi mboh nambri ma a nati a ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">mata ariri nnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">tsifa la ndohmoh anzoh mboh alilehndeh reh ma a nza mboh nambri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Areh nza ka a trina, meh kǝ nza inza ka, a bu ida Nnoh ata nza bu dasa ata bleh ata zanana reh ma a vuru. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh atehrehkifi na anyi, nza ma a bu na bishi abibi atehrehkifi na anyi reh, maka a kate anyi ida Nnoh reh, ma a were akuri zanana tasa za ma a lafa a gbo agohsoh amoh mboh na rishi ata kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwrii. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Anyimbehreh nimeh awumu aniye amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene reh, a ka nga mara tohmoh mboh atehrehkifi na anyi reh gbugba kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwrii atehrehkifi na anyi ata nza a bu na su na gofo Nnoh, ata nza a nati a hunji fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Ida Nnoh reh ka a su na inzo ata nza anyi na nga agba tasa wuwana Nnoh reh, akyo a nati a wina niye na nimeh ida Nnoh reh kpeh, la bishi abibi atehrehkifi na anyi ata mara tohmoh mboh atehrehkifi na anyi reh tana a trina fya.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Gbugba Mboh Ata Gofo Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Meh kǝ sehreh agba anyi yivoh atsi leh tsifa anyi ma ida Nnoh reh a na ni mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh atehrehkifi na anyi reh la, &lt;&lt;Na ni were kate nnoh gbugba atehrehkifi na anyi ata gofo Nnoh reh ma inziyo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata jiji reh ka a na na a were gbugba a ŋoh ma inziyo. Ibla abibi amboh anyi ata ma a rina veve kpeh maka kate ma itoh kyangwri amboh ata nza ma bu na kpra iwoaye reh, tasa amboh ata nza ma krumusu yafa a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata afri reh ka a were gbugba a ŋoh a na nimeh fini agba. Amwo reh ka a gyuruna a tswanza imya kohmoh kyangwri reh, awumu amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene nimeh fini agba reh maka a kwo nambri.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na atatoh reh ka a were gbugba ŋoh a na nimeh fini agba tasa nimeh amwo ata ka a kate anyi ma inzi, maka a gyuruna a te imya. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Meh kǝ sehreh agba Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata nza a bu na wuwana ma ikpi amwo mboh reh atsi bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">&lt;&lt;Hwra akpi anzoh reh a bu yehlehleh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">nnoh ata zanana reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">Tini yama na tutu, tasa za ni nati yama na tutu!<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Tsifa la ma a sangra na imya kyangwri Nnoh mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">tasa za ni nga mboh imya mata a wa, maka hunji andromboh ata nza ma leh a fa reh.<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Meh kǝ gyuru sehreh agba anyi a kate anyi ma bagadi a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">&lt;&lt;Ada Nnoh ata nza bu na wuwana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">Hwra akpi anzoh reh ma bu zizi tasa za ma bu yehlehleh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na aniye reh ka were gbugba ŋoh a na ma nnoh, maka nga ŋoh kira la ta afya kyangwri mboh tswanza shira reh. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Hwene ata nza a bu veve kpeh reh ka afya kyangwri mboh, maka a kya isa Nnoh, ata nza a bu na wuwana ma ikpi bishi abibi mboh reh. Mboh neh ma a nati a sohroh ata kpakpana amoh mboh mata riri agba a ŋoh reh kpeh.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata na atungu reh ka a were gbugba a ŋoh reh a na ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh iwoaye reh. Shini ka hama kpra Agohmoh ata iwoaye nza a de Agohmoh reh, kyangwri maka leh rya arimi amoh mboh la rina reh a keh, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />maka a leh a kya Nnoh ata nza a bu ma inza tsifa rina tasa ibla a moh reh. mboh neh ma sohroh gyuruna ta akeki agugu amoh mboh reh kpeh.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata atehrehkifi reh ka a were gbugba a ŋoh reh a na nimeh fini akre Yufiretis. Fini akre reh ka afya a hwara, la ta a lisa aki ma agohgohmoh amboh ata nza ma a nati anyi mgba nnoh nerebi a ba reh. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Neh meh kǝ gyuru nza huru abibi amboh anyi za mboh atatoh ma a tswanza injwara mboh. anyimbehreh a kate anyi ma aniye iyo, anyi a kate anyi ma aniye iwoaye, anyi za ka a kate anyi ma aniye kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ata huru tsifa reh. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Abibi huru mboh reh ma bu huru inyo mboh ata nza ma a leh a lisa kpra shi nza ŋara aniye mboh reh. Huru mboh atatoh reh ma kate a na ni agohgohmoh mboh ma inziyo reh, la mata a de mboh a ba ma akpo anyimbehreh tsifa mlana gofo ata nza a nati a ba ma ibi agba ata hwra akpi Nnoh reh.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />Ada reh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Sehreh nnoh! mya meh nati ba tswanza ayuhu reh! Te atoh a nati a bu na akyo ata nza a tuma iyo alete a nza akuri a ŋoh mboh, la ŋoh ta hende na mgbimgbi ta a te ŋoh na isa na duma mboh kpeh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Huru agugu mboh reh maka a wa agohgohmoh mboh reh a ba ma a gbo anyi ata maka a fi na arimi Yahudawa mboh la Armegeddo.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata atehrehkifi na anyi reh ka a were gbugba a ŋoh a kate ma inyo. Agba anyi yivoh ka agohroh a kate anyi kpra Agohmoh ata ida Nnoh reh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kǝ trina!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Zana tasa ryanza tasa sesenge tasa gohroh kpalala, tasa za inzi ka a zuzuna. Inzi kǝ hehreh zuzuna ika wohroh kpeh a gu anyi ameh ata ta maka a lisa kyangwri reh; inzi reh a zuzuna gaga abibi mi. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Akpo afiya agba ata nza ma a fi la Babila reh ka a hwashina a te atatoh, tasa za maka a lofo akpokpo afiyafiya kyangwri mboh reh nambri. Nnoh ka a kohnoh na Babila afiya agba reh, ka a de ŋoh la ta a wa amwo inabi nimeh hohndoh wa amwo a ŋoh reh, amwo inabi reh a bu ata gofo abibi Nnoh reh. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Inzizi a tuhwara mboh reh maka a lalana, tasa agbohgboh mboh za maka a bleh nambri. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Agbugba talala mboh maka a tamba anyi inza a hwa ma ikpi kyangwri mboh, arishi a tswa atsi bu kilo agrumavoh dida atungu. Kyangwri maka a kya Nnoh ma ikpi talala mboh nza ma a tamba anyi ma inza reh, tsifa la andromboh reh a nga mboh nyiri veve kpeh.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Angra Agba Tasa Iwoaye Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Neh anyimbehreh nimeh mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh atehrehkifi na anyi ata nza a bu na gbugba atehrehkifi na anyi reh ka a ba ba bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Ba, meh nati tsana noh iya ata nza ma nati a nga angra agba reh, akpo afya agba ata nza ma a mina ma inda fini mboh gaga reh. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Agohgohmoh mboh ata inziyo tama ka a leh ahohndoh na ŋoh, tasa kyangwri amboh inziyo maka te ifiya la ma wa amwo inabi ata abibi ata leh ahondoh na a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Huru ka a tamba a ba meh, tasa amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ka a gu meh a na akpo inzi a tuhwara anyi. Ma a huru meh kǝ nza afya anyi a tuma ma ikpi iwoaye atisha ata nza a bu na isa amboh ata nza a kya Nnoh a goh ma itoh a ŋoh; iwoaye reh a bu na ikpi atehrehkifi na anyi tasa atamaa mboh grumavo. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Afya reh a jimi na akuri kpakpa hungroh ata nza a sha kroh, tasa atishaa, tasa za ma a hama na awumu zana ata ma a lisa na kpakpa alilehndeh, ma bu kpakpa hungroh, tasa a kpakpa jimi mboh. A de hohndoh ata kpakpa hungroh ahungwri, ata awumu abibi nza ma a su nimeh reh, tsifa hende leh ahondoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Ma a ŋa isa anyi ma gbomo ŋoh ata nza bu na lomo ata huho ŋoh la: &lt;&lt;Babila agba, akre angra mboh nambri tasa awumu ata nza maka a sehreh ma inziyo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Tasa za meh kǝ nza la afya reh a wa imya kyangwri Nnoh mboh a te ifiya tasa imya amboh ata nza ma a mla mboh la ma a tufa Yeso yehlehleh reh. Nza meh kǝ nza ŋoh reh, meh kǝ shi nza ŋara aniye ma. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka luhu meh la, &lt;&lt;Ni shi ŋara aniye ma tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Meh nati bleh noh lomo huho ata afya nza a tuma ma ikpi iwoaye reh, tasa lomo huho ata nza a gu iwo reh. Iwoaye ata nza a bu na ikpi atehrehkifi na anyi tasa atamaa agrumavoh reh. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Woaye wohroh reh tana a bu na fene, nehnehreh a za a bu na fene za kpeh; Wa a nati a kate anyi nimeh itsiyo agba reh ta a na atsi ata nza ma a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo reh. Kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu ma inziyo, amboh ata nza ma a sohroh a ŋa isa amoh mboh kpeh feh masa a lisa inziyo nimeh amgbasho ata amboh fene mboh, ma a nati a ŋara aniye mata a shi a nza iwoaye reh. Tana a bu na fene; nehnehreh a za a bu na fene za kpeh, neh a nati a gyuru a kate za.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />&lt;&lt;Areh a kira lomo tasa wina. Ikpikpi atehrehkifi na anyi reh ma bu agbohgboh mboh, ata afiya nza a tuma ma ikpi ŋoh mboh reh. Ma a bu agohgohmoh mboh atehrehkifi na anyi: <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Atungu nimeh amoh maa a hwa, anyimbehreh a treh a de Agohmoh, tasa anyi a treh a ba; nza tana a ba reh, a nati a zaka a de Agohmoh reh shidima kanga. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Tasa iwoaye ata ta ka a bu na fene na kpikpi reh, nehnehreh neh a za a bu na fene za kpeh, ata wohroh reh a bu Agohmoh ata na atsiyatsiya reh ata nza bu nimeh atehrehkifi reh ma a nati a mla a kwo <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />&lt;&lt;Atamaa agrumavoh ata nza ni nza reh a bu agohgohmoh agrumavoh amboh ata maa a hehreh a de Agohmoh kpeh, neh ma a nati a nga mboh wuwana mata a de Agohmoh shidi ma mboh ma iwoaye reh. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Mboh agrumavoh reh kohnoh amoh a bu anyimbehreh, tasa za maka nga wuwana amoh tasa kpra de Agohmoh reh ma iwoaye reh. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Ma a nati a mla na na ameh Atashi reh; neh ameh Atashi reh, tasa amboh ata nza a fi mboh reh, amboh ata nza ma a seh mboh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a tufa yehlehleh reh, ma a nati a keh wuwana amoh, la ŋoh a bu Ada ata Ada mboh tasa Agohmoh agohgohmoh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Amwo mboh nza ni nza reh, ata angra nza a tuma reh, a bu akpokpo atsifi, Kyangwri mboh, achifi mboh, tasa arimi mboh. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Atamaa mboh agrumavoh ata nza ni nza tasa iwoaye reh ma a nati a la kpeh na angra reh; ma a nati a sa awumu a ŋoh a hwa na nambri mata ata ŋoh na mgbimgbi; ma a nati a rya uwo itoh a ŋoh tasa mata afya na shira. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />La Nnoh kǝ gya ma agohsoh amoh, kira ata lisa andromboh ata nza a bu ma agohsoh amoh, nimeh kira ŋoh ma aki lisa ma amoh tasa mata nga ma iwoaye reh wuwana ata de Agohmoh tsifa Nnoh tana a su feh. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Afya ata nza ni nza reh a bu akpo afiya agba ata nza a de agohgohmoh amboh inziyo reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Babila reh A hwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Wohroh nza ka gǝga meh kǝ nza amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi waka kate a tamba anyi inza. A bu na Wuwana de Agohmoh, zana agba ŋoh ka a zana inziyo reh nambri. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Ka a te kpiriga na agba yivoh la kǝ hwa: &lt;&lt;Akpo afya agba ata Babila reh kǝ hwa! Kǝ bu atsi tuma Huru inyo mboh tasa ata huru agugu mboh; abibi akuku amboh nza ma a bu arishi ma maka tuma ma a huru. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />La akpokpo afiyafiya mboh reh nambri ma a wa amwo inabi a ŋoh reh, amwo inabi ata wuwana a ŋoh ata kira hende leh ahondoh abibi ndohmoh mboh reh. Agohgohmoh amboh inziyo maka a leh ahohndoh na a ŋoh reh, amboh hende sa awumu rifa ma inziyo maka a te asabara na kira nza nana a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Neh meh kǝ gyuru sehreh agba anyi ma inza ka bleh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">&lt;&lt;Kyangwri amya mboh! kate nnoh, kate nyi nnoh nimeh a ŋoh!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">Kama fi noh ikpi amohnoh nimeh kpakpana reh kpeh; kama kira ti nza noh iya na a ŋoh kpeh kanga!<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />La ma a cha kpakpana a ŋoh mboh reh a gya a ka a tswa atsi bara inza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">tasa za Nnoh a kohnoh na akeki agugu a ŋoh mboh reh.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Lisa nnoh tswanza ŋoh za nza a lisa nnoh reh;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">lisa nnoh ika ata ŋoh za nza a lisa reh a te na afri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Nga noh awumu wa ata nza a wuwana ma hohndoh reh a te na afri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">tswanza wa ika ata ŋoh za ta ka a lisa nnoh reh.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Nga noh iya tasa kputu agohsoh gaga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">tswanza agba tasa nana ata ŋoh nza nga ikpi a ŋoh reh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">&lt;Mya meh tuma uwe, Agohmoh afya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Meh sohroh bu afya kunu kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">meh nati tuma kpanga kwo kpeh!&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Tsifa wohroh, ibi anyi ma a nati a mla Babila na adamwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">bishi mboh tasa kputu agohsoh, tasa nyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Tasa ma a nati afya ŋoh na shira, la Ada Nnoh, ata nza hwra ŋoh akpi reh, a bu na agba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Agohgohmoh ata inziyo amboh ata nza ma Leh ahondoh na a ŋoh, tasa te iyo a ŋoh reh ma a nati a kpanga mata rinana ma ikpi akpo afya reh nza ma a nza inzo shira ata nza afya ŋoh reh. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Ma a shi ma gbugba, la ma a nyiri mata kama a te iya na a ŋoh kpeh. Ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Iya ata areh a bu veve kpeh! tasa nga nyiri! Akpo afya agba ata Babila! nimeh a wa anyimbehreh ma iya anzoh ka a de noh a te iya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Amboh sa awumu rifa ata inziyo za ma a kpanga rinana ma Babila reh, la akyo a sohroh a za a sa awumu amoh za kpeh; <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />akyo a za a sa kpakpa hungroh atasaa, tasa kpakpa alilehndeh; a kpakpa mboh, kuri atisha alilehndeh mboh, akuri ata kunaa mboh, akuri amwo ikroh, tasa awumu ata serenaa, tasa akuri atisha, tasa biroh agbeh lisa awumu angǝshi mboh reh nambri, tasa mgbiri awumu amboh ata nza ma a lisa na anyini inyi, tasa agbeh iwi ata kpakpa amwo asubeh, tasa karafi, tasa kpakpa ata srehmehnaa; <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />tasa sinamo, tasa awumu shimba ta tasa awumu angǝshi tasa mur tasa awumu angǝshi; amwo inabi tasa amehneh akpehngeh tasa mgbokro alikama tasa Londo mboh tasa Atashi mboh tasa Nyama mboh tasa Jaki mboh tasa akroh fira awumu mboh tasa ahwra tasa fene kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Amboh hende sa awumu rifa reh maka bleh Babila reh la, &lt;&lt;Mara agbeh ata binaa ata nza ni kira la ti hunji reh kǝ bre, asabara tasa awumu jimi anzoh mboh reh nambri maa a na amoh, tasa za ni nati sohroh hunji mboh za kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Amboh sa awumu rifa, amboh ata nza ma a te asabara ma atsi rifa na awumu ma akpo afya wohroh reh, ma a nati a shi ma gbugba, la mboh ma a nyiri la mboh za tama a nza iya ika ata a ŋoh reh za. Ma a nati a kpanga were ivoh ma agba, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Iya agba! Iya agba na akpo afya agba wohroh! A ka a jimi na kuri atisha, tasa ata nza a sha kroh, tasa atishaa, tasa ka a jimi itoh a ŋoh na kuri kpakpa hungroh mboh, tasa kpakpa alindeh mboh tasa a kpakpa ata kpakpa hungroh mboh! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Tasa nimeh a wa anyimbehreh ka a kasa na asabara ŋoh mboh reh nambri!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Amboh gbogblondo amwo reh, tasa amboh nza ma a bu nimeh, tasa amboh kama ŋoh tasa amboh ata nza ma a ka a hunji hungroh tasa irya anyi ma amwo reh, maka a shi ma gbugba, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />nza maka a nza inzo shira nza afya Babila reh maka kpanga. &lt;&lt;Ma a hehreh a nza akpo afya anyi tswanza akpo afya agba wohroh kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Maka a were avru ma ikpi amoh mboh, maka a kpanga a were ivoh ma agba, a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Iya agba, hahai na akpo afya! A bu akpo afya ata amboh ata nza ma a bu na gbogblondo amwo tasa za maka a kama a hehndeh nimeh a ŋoh maka a te asabara nimeh asabara a ŋoh! Nimeh a wa anyimbehreh ka a kasa na awumu mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="REV 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Johjoh nnoh, amboh ata nza ni bu noh ma inza tsifa la maa a druhu Babila tsifa amohnoh! Johjoh nnoh, mohnoh kyangwri Nnoh mboh tasa amboh sa tsifa nana mboh bleh! tasa amboh sa tsifa Nnoh a bleh la Nnoh kǝ hwra akpi ma akpo afya reh ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a lisa nnoh tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh! Nnoh kǝ hwra ŋoh akpi ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a lisa nnoh reh.<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Neh amehreh tohmoh Nnoh agba anyi ka a gu kpakpa ma a tswanza kpakpahwa reh ka a gu a fi a na ma fini akre ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Akpo afya Babila agba reh a nati a hwa abibi ma ika ta areh tasa za ma a nati a za a nza ŋoh za kpeh. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Ma a nati a za a sehreh amumu ata amboh mini ngohngoh, tasa agba kyangwri mboh, ha amboh wri afifi tasa amboh wri drumu nimeh anzoh za kpeh! Ha amboh te ndohmoh anyi nimeh anzoh a nati a za a yama kpeh; tasa ma a nati a za a sehreh gohroh kpakpa hwa kpeh! <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Ma a nati a za a nza zana shira nimeh anzoh za kpeh; ma a nati a za a sehreh agba afya afeh ha atsifa nza a sa afya afeh za kpeh. amboh sa awumu hende rifa anzoh tama a keh mgbiri mboh ma inziyo nambri, tasa za tini landa kyangwri mboh na akabeh huru tsifa a ŋoh ma inziyo nambri!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Tama a de Babila a te iya ma ikpi tsifa imya amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh tasa kyangwri Nnoh mboh za ma a were ma akpo afya reh; ha, imya ata amboh ata ma ta ka a mla mboh a kwo ma inziyo nambri.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Wohroh nza ka gǝga meh kǝ sehreh andromboh anyi ata nza agohroh tswanza duma agba kyangwri mboh ma a dohsohna ma inza, ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Riri ta a bu na Nnoh! nvara, nga agba, tasa wuwana a bu na Nnoh ambohroh! <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Hwra kpi a ŋoh mboh ma a bu zizi tasa za ma bu yehlehleh! Kǝ hwra akpi ma angra ata ta ka a chakafa inziyo na ndohmoh hende leh ahohndoh a ŋoh reh. Nnoh kǝ nga ŋoh iya la a mla amboh ahwra a ŋoh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Ma a gyuru a te kpiriga za la, Riri a bu na Nnoh! Inzo ata nza a kate anyi nimeh shira ata nza anyi nimeh shira ata nza a lofo akpo afya agba reh ka a ka a na inza ata tuma atono!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Agbugba mboh agrumavoh dida afri a hwa anneh tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene mboh anneh reh maka a hwa tamba maka ariri Nnoh, ata ta ka a tuma ma kpra Agohmoh reh. Maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Avoh dehreh! Riri ta a bu na Nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa Afya Ata Ameh Atashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Neh agba anyi ka a kate anyi ma kpra Agohmoh reh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Riri turoh Nnoh ambohroh, ahwra a ŋoh mboh tasa kyangwri mboh nambri, a wa agbugba mboh tasa akǝkehreh mboh, amboh ata nza ma a nyiri ŋoh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Neh meh kǝ sehreh andromboh anyi agohroh tswanza agba duma mboh reh, tswanza a bu amwo a tamba anyi ma agbohgboh, tswanza a bu kpalala agohroh reh. Meh kǝ sehreh mboh ma bleh la, &lt;&lt;Riri a bu na Nnoh! la, Ada Nnoh agba ambohroh reh, a bu Agohmoh! <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Ba nnoh meh ti johjoh meh ti kpona; ba nnoh meh ti riri agba ŋoh! La ameh wa afya ata ameh atashi reh kǝ ba, tasa la afya a ŋoh reh kǝ jimi ikpi a ŋoh tuma bana.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Maka nga ŋoh kuri lilin nza zanana tasa ata gu iyo la ta a were.&gt;&gt; (Kuri lilin reh a bu ndohmoh alindeh ata kyangwri Nnoh mboh.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Ŋa ata areh la, te atoh a bu na amboh ata nza ma a fi mboh a ba ma atsi kira wa afya ata Ameh atashi reh.&gt;&gt; Tasa amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a bleh a mangara za la, &lt;&lt;Areh a bu a zizi tsifa Nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Meh kǝ hwa ma tomo a ŋoh krumusu ŋoh, neh ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Kama lisa dehreh kpeh! Mya za meh bu atohngoh amohnoh ahwra twanza mohnoh tasa mgbiri amboh tufa mboh reh za, amboh ata nza ma a de tsifa Yeso ata a zizi reh. Krumusu turoh Nnoh ma tsene!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">A zizi ata Yeso nza a tsana a kate reh, a bu wohroh nza nga huru ma amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyangwri Kama Nyama Ma Ikpi Nyama Atasaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Neh meh kǝ nza Inza ka vuruna, meh kǝ nza nyama atasaa anyi. Maka a fi kyangwri kama ŋoh reh la Yehlehleh tasa Zizi; A ka ahwra akpi ata a zizi tasa mlana ata gofo. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Iyo a ŋoh a tswanza arimi shira, tasa za a lafa gbama mboh gaga ma ikpi a ŋoh. Ma a ŋa isa ma ikpi a ŋoh reh, neh a bu ŋoh tsene ma nza a wina andromboh ata nza ma a ŋa reh. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Izeh kuri nza a were reh a te mya. Isa a ŋoh a bu &lt;&lt;Tsifa Nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Amboh de ita mboh ata Inza maka a tufa ŋoh, ma a ka ma ikpi nyama atatasaa tasa ma a jimi mboh na kuri Linen atatasaa ata nza a zanana. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Ambya gara ata nza a rya ka a kate anyi ma aniye a ŋoh, ka a rya akpokpo atsifi mboh na wohroh. A nati a de mboh Agohmoh na wuwana, a nati a huya amwo inabi a kate ma atsi huya amwo inabi ata gofo agba ata Nnoh agba. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Ma kuri a ŋoh tasa ma ritsi a ŋoh ma a ŋa isa la: &lt;&lt;Agohmoh Agohgohmoh mboh, tasa Ada ata Ada mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Neh meh kǝ nza amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi ka a shi ma nnoh. Ka a te kpiriga a bleh na agba yivoh ma akuku mboh nambri nza ma a hehndeh ma inza reh la: &lt;&lt;Ba bu dohsohna nnoh nambri ma kira agba ata Nnoh reh! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Ba bu rya nnoh iwo agohgohmoh mboh, agbugba amoh mboh, tasa amboh na gofo amoh mboh, iwo nyama amoh mboh tasa amboh kama ŋoh mboh, iwo kyangwri mboh nambri, ahwra tasa amboh wusu ŋoh mboh, agbugba tasa akǝkehreh mboh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Neh meh kǝ nza iwoaye reh tasa agohgohmoh ata inziyo tasa amboh na gofo amoh mboh ma a dohsohna a na gofo na ata nza a tuma ma nyama tasa amboh de ita a ŋoh mboh reh za. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Maka a de iwoaye reh a fi ma ida ka, mboh ma kyangwri bleh tsifa Nnoh bleh ata huru tsifa ata nza a lisa awumu agbugba ma tomo a ŋoh reh. (A lisa awumu agbugba amboh wohroh reh ŋa a landa amboh ata nza ma a bu na kpra ata iwoaye reh tasa amboh ata nza ma krumusu yafa a ŋoh reh.) Iwoaye mboh reh tasa amboh bleh tsifa Nnoh ata huru tsifa reh, maka a fira mboh a were a na nimeh itsiyo shira agba ata nza ka afya anyungo reh na fene. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Nnoh a mla amboh de ita amoh mboh reh na ambya gara, ata nza a kate anyi ma aniye kyangwri ata nza ta ka a kama nyama reh; akuku mboh nambri maka a rya iwo amoh mboh reh.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Ahushi Dubu Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Neh meh kǝ nza amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi wa a tamba anyi inza, a de akpreh vuru itsiyo agba reh ma ivoh ŋoh, tasa njehnjehreh agba. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Ka a de iyoh reh, achoh iyoh reh, a bu wohroh nza bu Agugu reh, ha Shetan tasa za ka a lafa ŋoh a te ahushi dubu. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a gu ŋoh a shebiri a na nimeh itsiyo agba reh, ka a hama, ta ka a ka ŋoh, la ta a kama a landa akpokpo atsifi mboh za kpeh, ahushi dubu reh tana a gǝga feh. Wohroh tana a gǝga ma a nati a hingre ŋoh shidi.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Neh meh kǝ nza kpra agohgohmoh mboh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a tuma ma ikpi ŋoh reh maka nga mboh wuwana ata hwra akpi. Tasa za meh kǝ nza fene kyangwri amboh ata ma ta ka a mla mboh a kwo reh, la tama bleh zizi ata Yeso nza vuru reh, tasa tsifa Nnoh reh. Ma a sohroh a krumusu iwoaye reh ha yafa a ŋoh kpeh, ha la mata a sa kpra ata iwoaye reh ma gbomo amoh ha ma ivoh amoh mboh. Tama a ba inziyo maka a de kpra tswanza agohgohmoh mboh ma Kristi a gu ahushi dubu. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Mgbiri amboh ata nza ma a kwo reh ma a za a gyuru a ba kpeh la ahushi dubu tana a su feh.) Areh a bu gyuru hinga ata amboh kwo mboh ata jiji ŋoh reh. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Te atoh tasa zanana ta a bu na amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh jiji hinga ata amboh kwo mboh reh. Kwo ata afri ŋoh a nati a bu na wuwana ma ikpi amoh kpeh; ma a nati a bu firist ata Nnoh tasa ata Kristi, tasa ma a nati a de Agohmoh na a ŋoh a te ahushi mboh dubu.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A keh Wuwana Shetan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Ahushi dubu nza a ka a gǝga, ma a nati a hingre Shetan anyi ma ida ka a ŋoh reh, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />tasa a nati a kate a nati a hehndeh a landa akpokpo atsifi mboh nza ma a treh atsifi ma inziyo, wohroh reh ma a bu Gog tasa Magog. Shetan, a nati a fi mboh la mata a na mlana gofo, ma bu gaga a tswanza asehngeh ata fini agba reh. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Ma a sangrana a treh atsifa ma inziyo, tasa mata a goh akpo afiya ata kyangwri Nnoh mboh nza ma a yama reh, tasa akpo afya ata Nnoh nza a kira reh. Neh shira ka a kate anyi inza ka a ba ba a lofo mboh. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Neh Agugu, ata nza a ka a landa mboh reh, maka a gu ŋoh a fi ma shira agba ata ka afya anyungo reh, ma atsi ata nza ma a gu iwoaye tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh ata huru tsifa a bleh reh; ma a huru ma a nati a te iya ata tuma atono.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hwra Akpi Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Neh meh kǝ nza kpra Agohmoh atasaa anyi tasa ata nza a tuma ma ikpi ŋoh. Inza tasa Inziyo maka a gbo ma tomo a ŋoh tasa maka a za a nza mboh kpeh. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Meh kǝ nza amboh ata nza ma a kwo, agbugba tasa akǝkehreh, ma a shi ma tomo kpra Agohmoh reh. Maka a vuru amgbasho mboh, neh maka a vuru amgbasho anyi za, amgbasho ata amboh fene mboh. Maka ahwra akpi ma amboh ata nza ma a kwo na andromboh ata mboh nza ma a lisa, ika ata nza a ŋa ma amgbasho mboh reh. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Neh fini agba ka a de amboh ata nza ma a kwo nimeh a ŋoh a ba. Kwo tasa inziyo ata amboh kwo mboh za, maka a de amboh kwo ata mboh za a de a ba. Tasa za maka ahwra mboh akpi na andromboh ata mboh nza ma a lisa. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Neh maka a gu kwo tasa atsi ata amboh kwo mboh nza ma a yama reh a were a na nimeh shira agba. (Shira agba reh a bu kwo ata na afri ŋoh.) <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Amboh ata isa amoh nza ma a sohroh a ŋa nimeh amgbasho ata amboh fene kpeh reh maka a fira mboh a were nimeh shira agba.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Inza Afeh reh Tasa Inziyo Afeh reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Neh meh kǝ nza Inza afeh reh tasa Inziyo afeh reh. Inzi tasa Inziyo atono kǝ lalana bre, fini agba za ka trina. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Meh kǝ nza akpo afya ata zanana, wurushalima afeh reh, waka tamba anyi na Nnoh Inza, ma a lisa a gya a bana, tswanza afya afeh nza ma a lisa a bana dohsohna na atsifa a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Meh kǝ sere agba anyi ka atsifa anyi ma kpra Agohmoh Nnoh la: &lt;&lt;Nehnehreh afya Nnoh a bu na kyangwri mboh! A nati a tuma na amoh, tasa ma a nati a bu kyangwri a ŋoh mboh. Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh a nati a bu na amoh, tasa a nati a bu Nnoh amoh. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />A nati a firu mboh mwueneh anyi ma iyo amoh mboh. Kwo a nati a za a yama kpeh, kputu agohsoh ha kpanga ha rina. Awumu amboh atono maa a lalana a bleh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Neh Nnoh ata nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nehnehreh meh lisa awumu mboh afeh nambri!&gt;&gt; Ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Ŋa ata areh la tsifa amboh areh ma a bu zizi tasa a bu na sa kira.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Ka a bleh za la, &lt;&lt;Kǝ trina! meh bu Alfa tasa Omega, ata jiji tasa ata trina ŋoh. Na akyo ata nza yohroh amwo nza a keh ŋoh meh nati nga ŋoh kira ta a wa anyi ma tsiyo amwo ata hunji fene ta kama a fanga kpeh. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Amboh ata nza ma a shi a wuwana a keh reh ma a nati a hunji gohmoh anyi na amya: Meh nati bu Nnoh amoh, mboh neh ma a nati a bu mara amya mboh. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Amboh nyiri mboh, amboh kyehnehna na, amboh lisa awumu sere, amboh mla kyangwri mboh kwo, amboh lisa awumu abibi, amboh lisa awumu a soh, amboh tufa nnoh amboh wusu, tasa amboh agugu mboh nambri, atsifi amoh a bu akre shira agba nza a de na shira abibi, wohroh reh a bu kwo ata na afri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wurushalima Afeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Anyimbehreh nimeh mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh ata nza a bu na gbugba nza ma a were iya atehrehkifi ata trina ŋoh ka a ba ba a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Ba, meh nati tsana noh afya afeh, ata nza bu afya ameh Atashi reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Huru ka tamba ma ikpi amya, tasa Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ka a gu meh a ka a na ma ikpi amba agba. Ka tsana meh Wurushalima, Akpo Afya Ata zanana, ka a kate a tamba anyi Inza na Nnoh <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />tasa ka srehmehna na alindeh ata Nnoh. Akpo afya nza na a srehmehna tswanza kpakpa hungroh, nza a tswanza yasfa, a srehmehna tswanza madubi. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Ma a mina a goh a ka inza, tasa a bu na anida agrumavoh a hwa afri tasa mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri ma bu amboh ata nza ma a tuma a sumu anida mboh reh. Ma anida mboh reh ma a ŋa isa alohsoh Israila mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Anida atatoh ma a yama ma akachi mboh reh a gohdohsoh: atatoh na mgba nnoh nerebi, atatoh na mgba afo, atatoh na mgba shwa, tasa atatoh na mgba nnoh Nvishi. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Ma a mina chuhu mina a goh akpo afya reh na kpakpa agrumavoh a hwa afri, tasa ma a ŋa isa amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso a bleh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri ata ameh atashi reh.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ata nza atsifa na amya reh a bu na ikpoh tsara ata nza ma a lisa na kpakpa hungroh ta a tsara akpo afya reh, anida, tasa minagoh reh. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Ma a tsara mina goh akpo afya reh yehlehleh, fesena ŋoh tasa zeh ŋoh. Kyangwri tohmoh Nnoh reh a tsara akpo afya reh na ikpoh tsara a ŋoh: ata zeh ŋoh a bu mel dubu anyimbehreh na deri atungu tasa fesena ŋoh tasa hinga ŋoh a tswanza zeh ŋoh reh za. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Kyangwri tohmoh Nnoh reh ka tsara minagoh reh, izeh ŋoh a bu hwana 216, nimeh aki tsara ŋoh ata nza a ka a tsara reh. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Ma a lisa minagoh reh na kpakpa anyi nza maka a fi la yasfa, tasa ma a lisa akpo afya reh na kpakpa hungroh tsene, a za tswanza madubi. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Kpakpa chuhu ata nza ma a mina a goh akpo afiya agba reh ma jimi na kpakpa hungroh mboh ma asaa. Ma a fi kpakpa ata anyimbehreh la Yasfa, na afri ŋoh a bu safaya, na atatoh ŋoh a bu agat, na anneh ŋoh a bu zumurrudu, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />ata atungu ŋoh a bu onis, ata atehrehkifi ŋoh a bu Karneliyan, ata atehrehkifi na anyi ŋoh a bu Kirisolat, ata atsiyatsiya ŋoh a bu beril, ata atsiyatsiya na anyi ŋoh a bu tofas, ata agrumavoh ŋoh a bu daimon, ata agrumavoh hwa anyimbehreh ŋoh a bu yasin, ata agrumavoh hwa afri ŋoh a bu amehtis <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Anida agrumavoh a hwa afri reh ma a lisa na a kpakpa mboh; ma a lisa anida mboh reh ma na kpakpa hungroh mboh reh anyinyi. Akeki hende ma akpo afya reh ma a lisa na kpakpa hungroh tsene, a zana a hwana tswanza madubi.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Meh sohroh nza ida Nnoh ma akpo afya reh kpeh, la ida Nnoh amoh reh a bu Ada Nnoh agbagbaa tasa ameh atashi. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Akpo Afya reh a sohroh a kira nnoh ha nara ta zana ŋoh kpeh, la ameh Atashi reh a ka a zana ŋoh. Ameh ata shi ka bu afitila <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Kyangwri inziyo ma a nati a hehndeh ma zanana a ŋoh, tasa agohgohmoh amboh inziyo ma a nati a de asabara amoh a na ma akpo afya reh. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Anida akpo afya reh a nati a shi vuru ŋoh anyi avoh nerebi a na na a te Nvishi; ma a nati a sohroh a hama kpeh, la shini a nati a sohroh a yama ma a huru kpeh. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Ma a nati a de agba tasa asabara ata akpokpo atsifi mboh a ba ma akpo afya reh. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Neh andromboh abibi a nati a sohroh aniye a na nimeh akpo afya reh kpeh, ha akyo anyi ata nza a lisa awumu te na isa ha kyangwri huru tsifa. A bu amboh ata nza ma a ŋa isa amoh ma amgbasho ata Ameh atashi ata amboh fene ma a nati aniye ma akpo afya reh.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka tsana meh fini ata amwo fene, a gu iyo a tswanza akroh nza tomo, waka anyi ma Kpra Agohmoh Nnoh a ba tasa ata ameh atashi <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />ka a gbo a tamba ma atsitsifi akpo afya reh. Ma akachi fini mboh reh agbeh ata hunji fene a yama, a ka a mara a te a hwana agrumavoh a hwa afri ma ahushi anyimbehreh, ka a mara ma anara ŋoh; asho agbeh reh a ka nga wuwana ma kyangwri mboh a treh atsifi. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Andromboh ata Nnoh nza a leke a sohroh a yama ma akpo afya agba reh kpeh. Kpra Agohmoh ata Nnoh tasa ata ameh Atashi a nati a bu ma akpo afya agba reh, tasa ahwra a ŋoh mboh ma a nati a krumusu ŋoh. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Ma a nati a nza tomo a ŋoh, tasa ma a nati a ŋa isa a ŋoh ma ikpi gbomo amoh mboh. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Shini a nati a za a hungwa kpeh, tasa za ma a nati a za a kira afitila ha zanana ata nnoh kpeh, la Ada Nnoh a nati a bu zanana amoh, tasa za ma a nati a de kpra tswanza agohgohmoh mboh ata tuma atono.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iba Ata Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Neh amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Tsifa amboh areh ma a bu zizi tasa za a bu na sa kira. Tasa ada Nnoh, ata nza a nga huru a ŋoh ma amboh sa tohmoh a ŋoh mboh a bleh reh, kǝ tohmoh kyangwri sa tohmoh a ŋoh ta a ba ba a tsana ma ahwra a ŋoh mboh andromboh ata nza a nati a ba nehnehreh kanga reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yeso ka a bleh la &lt;&lt;Kya ashotoh&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Meh nati ba fifi! Amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa ata amgbasho ata areh a kira reh ma a nati a johjoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Mya Ayohana, meh sehreh tasa meh kǝ nza awumu amboh areh nambri. Tasa za meh nza kǝ sere treh tasa meh ti nza awumu amboh areh reh, meh kǝ hwa tamba ma hwana amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata nza a tsana meh awumu mboh reh, mya la meh ti krumusu ŋoh. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ŋoh neh ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Kama lisa dehreh kpeh! Mya za meh bu atohngoh anzoh ahwra tswanza noh tasa atsi anzoh mboh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh tasa amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa ata nza a bu nimeh amgbasho areh a tufa. krumusu nnoh Nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Ka bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;Kama hama tsifa bleh gya ata amgbasho ata areh ta a bu tsifa ayuhu kpeh, la ameh kǝ ba whiri ata awumu amboh areh ma a nati a su. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Akyo ata nza a lisa agugu ta a rya tohmoh na lisa agugu reh, akyo ata nza a lisa andromboh abibi, ta a rya tohmoh na lisa andromboh abibi reh, akyo ata nza tufa yehlehleh ta a rya tohmwo na tufa yehlehleh reh, akyo ata nza a bu na zanana, ta a rya tohmoh na zanana reh.<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yeso ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyashotoh!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Meh nati ba fifi! meh nati de fanga amya ba, meh ti gafa ma kyangwri mboh reh ma asaa. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Mya meh bu Alfa tasa Omega jiji tasa trinaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Te atoh a bu na amboh ata nza ma a hwara akuri amoh a zanana tasa za a nati nga mboh kira mata a rya mara agbeh ata nza anyi ma agbeh ata hunji fene tasa mata a gǝga ma anida mboh a na ma akpo afya agba reh. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Amboh ata neh nza ma a nati a hunji niye nimeh akpo afiya reh kpeh, ma bu amboh lisa andromboh abibi, tasa amboh hama iyo, tasa amboh amboh hende leh ahohndoh, tasa amboh mla kyangwri mboh kwo, amboh ata nza ma a tufa nnoh akǝkehreh tasa amboh huru tsifa ma atsi tsifa tasa nimeh ndohmoh.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />&lt;&lt;Mya Yeso, meh tohmoh Amehreh tohmoh amya ta ahwra tsifa amboh areh a bleh noh ma dida Nnoh mboh. Mya meh bu ariri tasa meh nyi ma alohsoh Dawuda; Mya meh bu akpukpa zanana ata nerebi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Huru tasa atsifa afiya afeh reh ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ba!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Akyo ata nza a sehreh ata areh ta a bleh za la, &lt;&lt;Ba!&gt;&gt; kanga, Akyo ata yohroh amwo nza a keh ŋoh; ta a ba ba sa amwo ata hunji fene were reh.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Mya Ayohana, meh kpi ashotoh ma kyangwri ata nza a sehreh tsifa vuru tsana nimeh amgbasho ata areh: nza akyo anyi a mishi andromboh anyi nimeh ŋa reh, Nnoh a nati a mishi ŋoh iya tasa adamwa ata nza ma a ŋa a gya nimeh amgbasho reh. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Tasa nza akyo anyi ta a mishi a fufa yohroh tsifa anyi nimeh tsifa bleh gya nimeh amgbasho fene ata areh, Nnoh a nati a fufa anyi nimeh nga amoh ata mara agbeh ata hunji fene tasa ata akpo afya agba ata zanana reh, ata nza ma a tsana nimeh amgbasho ata areh.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Ata nza a bleh tsifa ma ikpi amboh areh nambri a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ha zizi! meh nati ba fifi!&gt;&gt; Ta a bu dehreh. Ba, Ada Yeso!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Lisa alindeh ata Ada Yeso ta a bu na kyangwri mboh nambri.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>